rprüfung von unterstützten Konstruktoren","Überprüfung von expliziten Zeitlimits"],"pt":["Validação de esquema contra schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json","Verificação semântica com scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py","Retorno de erros e warnings com caminhos JSON","Verificação de constructores suportados","Verificação de timeouts explícitos"],"ru":["Проверка схемы против schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json","Семантическая проверка с scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py","Возвращение ошибок и предупреждений с путями JSON","Проверка поддерживаемых конструкторов","Проверка явных таймаутов"],"ar":["التحقق من مخطط مقابل schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json","الاختبارات الدلالية مع scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py","إرجاع الأخطاء والتحذيرات مع مسارات JSON","التحقق من بناة المدعومة","التحقق من التايم أوت الصريح"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use marlowe-json-validator","marlowe-json-validator setup guide","marlowe-json-validator alternative","marlowe-json-validator vs jsonschema","marlowe-json-validator install","json validation tools","marlowe json validation","json schema validation"],"zh":["Marlowe JSON 验证","JSON 数据验证","AI 工具","Marlowe JSON 验证工具","JSON 验证库","Marlowe JSON 检验"],"ja":["Marlowe JSON 検証","JSON データ検証","AI エージェント","Marlowe JSON バリデーター","JSON 検証ライブラリ","Marlowe JSON チェック"],"ko":["Marlowe JSON 검증","JSON 데이터 검증","AI 툴","Marlowe JSON 검증기","JSON 검증 라이브러리","Marlowe JSON 검사"],"es":["validación JSON","marlowe-json-validator","seguridad de contratos","validación de esquema","comprobación semántica","herramientas de desarrollo","AI Agentes","validación de código"],"fr":["validation JSON","marlowe-json-validator","sécurité des contrats","validation de schéma","vérification sémantique","outils de développement","Agents IA","validation de code"],"de":["JSON-Validierung","marlowe-json-validator","Sicherheit von Verträgen","Schema-Validierung","semantische Überprüfung","Entwicklungstools","KI-Tools","Code-Validierung"],"pt":["marlowe-json-validator","validação de JSON","esquema de validação","verificação semântica","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","JSON Marlowe"],"ru":["ИИ Агент marlowe-json-validator","валидация JSON","проверка схемы","семантическая проверка","разработка приложений","инструменты разработки","JSON Marlowe"],"ar":["العامل marlowe-json-validator","تحقق JSON","التحقق من مخطط","الاختبارات الدلالية","تطوير التطبيقات","أدوات التطوير","JSON Marlowe"]}},"owner":"Toby1009","repo":"marlowe-to-move","repoPath":"Toby1009/marlowe-to-move","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T06:37:26Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"marlowe-json-validator","description":"Validate Marlowe Core JSON drafts for schema correctness, semantic consistency, and supported-subset compliance before lowering to Sui Move. Use when JSON is authored by humans or agents and must be checked for explicit timeouts, party/token references, bounded choices, completeness, and unsupported constructs.","bodyPreview":"# Purpose\n\nValidate Marlowe JSON before lowering.\n\nAccept JSON input and return one JSON object:\n- `{\"status\":\"valid\",...}`\n- `{\"status\":\"invalid\",\"errors\":[...],\"warnings\":[...]}`\n\n# Validation Pipeline\n\n1. Run schema validation against `schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json`.\n2. Run semantic checks with `scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py`.\n3. Return structured errors and warnings with JSON paths.\n\n# Mandatory Checks\n\n- Contract uses supported constructors only.\n- All timeouts are explicit","body":"# Purpose\n\nValidate Marlowe JSON before lowering.\n\nAccept JSON input and return one JSON object:\n- `{\"status\":\"valid\",...}`\n- `{\"status\":\"invalid\",\"errors\":[...],\"warnings\":[...]}`\n\n# Validation Pipeline\n\n1. Run schema validation against `schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json`.\n2. Run semantic checks with `scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py`.\n3. Return structured errors and warnings with JSON paths.\n\n# Mandatory Checks\n\n- Contract uses supported constructors only.\n- All timeouts are explicit absolute UNIX timestamps.\n- Monetary values are integers.\n- Party/Token/Payee/Choice references are structurally valid.\n- Multi-token contracts are allowed; check consistency and emit warnings when risky.\n- Choice bounds are non-empty and ordered.\n- Continuations are complete and reachable.\n- Obvious unsupported requirements are flagged.\n\n# Warning Policy\n\nEmit warnings for patterns that are legal JSON but high-risk design:\n- timeout too near current time\n- empty `when` cases\n- zero or negative payment constants\n- duplicated choice names by same role\n\n# Resources\n\n- Schema: `schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json`\n- Semantic checks: `references/semantic-checks.md`\n- Runner: `scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py`\n\nReturn JSON only.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T13:11:09.128Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Contract Analysis Agents needing precise Marlowe JSON validation and error reporting.","zh":"非常适合需要精确Marlowe JSON验证和错误报告的合同分析代理。","ja":"Marlowe JSONの正確な検証とエラーレポートが必要な契約分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확한 Marlowe JSON 검증 및 오류 보고가 필요한 계약 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Contratos que necesitan una validación precisa de Marlowe JSON y un informe de errores.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de contrats nécessitant une validation précise de Marlowe JSON et un rapport d''erreurs.","de":"Perfekt für Vertragsanalyse-Agents, die eine präzise Marlowe JSON-Validierung und Fehlerberichterstattung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Contratos que precisam de validação precisa de Marlowe JSON e relatórios de erros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа контрактов, требующих точной валидации Marlowe JSON и отчетов об ошибках.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل العقود الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق الدقيق من صحة Marlowe JSON وتقارير الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate Marlowe JSON against a supported subset schema, ensuring contracts use only supported constructors and explicit timeouts, with structured error and warning reporting using JSON paths, leveraging scripts like validate_marlowe_json.py.","zh":"赋予代理验证Marlowe JSON对支持的子集模式，确保合约仅使用支持的构造函数和显式超时，并使用JSON路径进行结构化错误和警告报告，利用脚本如validate_marlowe_json.py。","ja":"エージェントがMarlowe JSONをサポートされているサブセットスキーマに対して検証できるようにし、契約でサポートされているコンストラクタと明示的なタイムアウトのみを使用することを保証し、JSONパスを使用した構造化されたエラーや警告レポートを提供し、validate_marlowe_json.pyのようなスクリプトを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 지원되는 하위 집합 스키마에 대해 Marlowe JSON를 검증할 수 있도록 하여 계약에서 지원되는 생성자와 명시적 시간 초과만 사용하도록 보장하고 JSON 경로를 사용한 구조화된 오류 및 경고 보고를 제공하며 validate_marlowe_json.py 같은 스크립트를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar Marlowe JSON contra un subconjunto de esquema compatible, asegurando que los contratos utilicen solo constructores compatibles y tiempos de espera explícitos, con informes de errores y advertencias estructurados que utilizan rutas JSON, aprovechando scripts como validate_marlowe_json.py.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider Marlowe JSON contre un sous-ensemble de schéma pris en charge, en garantissant que les contrats n''utilisent que des constructeurs pris en charge et des délais d''attente explicites, avec des rapports d''erreurs et d''avertissements structurés qui utilisent des chemins JSON, en exploitant des scripts comme validate_marlowe_json.py.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Marlowe JSON gegen ein unterstütztes Teilschema zu validieren, sicherstellend, dass Verträge nur unterstützte Konstrukte und explizite Zeitüberschreitungen verwenden, mit strukturierten Fehler- und Warnungsmeldungen, die JSON-Pfade verwenden, unter Ausnutzung von Skripten wie validate_marlowe_json.py.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar Marlowe JSON contra um subconjunto de esquema suportado, garantindo que os contratos usem apenas construtores suportados e timeouts explícitos, com relatórios de erros e advertências estruturados usando caminhos JSON, aproveitando scripts como validate_marlowe_json.py.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проверять Marlowe JSON против поддерживаемого подмножества схемы, гарантируя, что контракты используют только поддерживаемые конструкторы и явные таймауты, с отчетами об ошибках и предупреждениях, структурированными с помощью путей JSON, используя скрипты, такие как validate_marlowe_json.py.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من التحقق من صحة Marlowe JSON مقابل جزء فرعي مدعوم من مخطط، مما يضمن أن العقود تستخدم فقط بناة مدعومة وآلات زمنية صريحة، مع تقارير الأخطاء والتحذيرات المنظمة باستخدام مسارات JSON، واستخدام البرامج النصية مثل validate_marlowe_json.py."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating Marlowe contracts before lowering","Debugging invalid Marlowe JSON with detailed error messages","Enforcing explicit timeouts in Marlowe contracts"],"zh":["在下降之前验证Marlowe合约","使用详细的错误消息调试无效的Marlowe JSON","在Marlowe合约中强制执行显式超时"],"ja":["下降前にMarlowe契約を検証する","詳細なエラーメッセージを使用して無効なMarlowe JSONをデバッグする","Marlowe契約で明示的なタイムアウトを強制する"],"ko":["하락 전에 Marlowe 계약을 검증합니다","상세한 오류 메시지를 사용하여 무효한 Marlowe JSON을 디버깅합니다","Marlowe 계약에서 명시적 시간 초과를 강제합니다"],"es":["Validar contratos Marlowe antes de reducir","Depurar Marlowe JSON inválido con mensajes de error detallados","Aplicar tiempos de espera explícitos en contratos Marlowe"],"fr":["Valider les contrats Marlowe avant de réduire","Déboguer Marlowe JSON invalide avec des messages d''erreur détaillés","Appliquer des délais d''attente explicites dans les contrats Marlowe"],"de":["Marlowe-Verträge vor der Reduzierung validieren","Ungültiges Marlowe JSON mit detaillierten Fehlermeldungen debuggen","Explizite Zeitüberschreitungen in Marlowe-Verträgen durchsetzen"],"pt":["Validar contratos Marlowe antes da redução","Depurar Marlowe JSON inválido com mensagens de erro detalhadas","Impor timeouts explícitos em contratos Marlowe"],"ru":["Проверка контрактов Marlowe перед снижением","Отладка недопустимого Marlowe JSON с подробными сообщениями об ошибках","Внедрение явных таймаутов в контрактах Marlowe"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة عقود Marlowe قبل التقليل","تصحيح Marlowe JSON غير صالح مع رسائل خطأ مفصلة","فرض آليات زمنية صريحة في عقود Marlowe"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json for validation","Python environment needed for scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py execution"],"zh":["需要schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json用于验证","需要Python环境来执行scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py"],"ja":["検証にschema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.jsonが必要","スクリプトの実行にPython環境が必要であるscripts/validate_marlowe_json.py"],"ko":["검증을 위해 schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json이 필요합니다","스크립트 실행을 위해 Python 환경이 필요한 scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py"],"es":["Requiere schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json para la validación","Entorno de Python necesario para la ejecución de scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py"],"fr":["Nécessite schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json pour la validation","Environnement Python nécessaire pour l''exécution de scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py"],"de":["Benötigt schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json für die Validierung","Python-Umgebung erforderlich für die Ausführung von scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py"],"pt":["Requer schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json para validação","Ambiente Python necessário para execução de scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py"],"ru":["Требуется schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json для проверки","Необходимо окружение Python для выполнения scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py"],"ar":["يتطلب schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json للتحقق من الصحة","بيئة Python ضرورية لتشغيل scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"803964e7478182de15a9fbb81722eb833cd1d5d9bd8f4aa5b8c8f9d036e5702a","qualityScore":26}');
