INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Toby1009/marlowe-to-move/marlowe-json-validator', 'marlowe-json-validator', 'Toby1009', 'marlowe-to-move', 'community', 'marlowe-json-validator Toby1009 marlowe-to-move community The marlowe-json-validator skill validates Marlowe JSON before lowering, ensuring contracts use supported constructors and explicit timeouts. It benefits developers working with Marlowe JSON. Marlowe JSON 验证工具用于验证 Marlowe JSON 数据，确保数据的有效性和一致性 Marlowe JSON バリデーターは Marlowe JSON データを検証するために使用され、データの有効性と一貫性を確保します Marlowe JSON 검증기는 Marlowe JSON 데이터를 검증하여 데이터의 유효성과 일관성을 보장합니다 El marlowe-json-validator es una herramienta que valida JSON antes de reducirlo, asegurando la seguridad de los contratos Le marlowe-json-validator est un outil qui valide JSON avant de le réduire, assurant la sécurité des contrats Der marlowe-json-validator ist ein Tool, das JSON vor der Reduzierung validiert und die Sicherheit der Verträge gewährleistet O marlowe-json-validator é uma ferramenta para validar JSON Marlowe. Ele executa uma pipelines de validação que inclui schema validation e semantic checks. ИИ Агент marlowe-json-validator - это инструмент для валидации JSON Marlowe. Он выполняет пайплайн валидации, включающий проверку схемы и семантические проверки. العامل marlowe-json-validator هو أداة لتحقق JSON Marlowe. وهو ينفذ مسارات تحقق تشمل التحقق من مخطط واختبارات دلالية. how to use marlowe-json-validator marlowe-json-validator setup guide marlowe-json-validator alternative marlowe-json-validator vs jsonschema marlowe-json-validator install json validation tools marlowe json validation json schema validation Marlowe JSON 验证 JSON 数据验证 AI 工具 Marlowe JSON 验证工具 JSON 验证库 Marlowe JSON 检验 Validates JSON input against schema/marlowe-supported-subset.schema.json Performs semantic checks using scripts/validate_marlowe_json.py Returns structured errors and warnings with JSON paths Checks for supported constructors only Verifies all timeouts are explicit marlowe-json-validator is a JSON validation tool that checks Marlowe JSON against a supported subset schema and performs semantic checks using Python scripts.');
