"دعم البرمجة gpu المتقدمة","التنمية النظمية عالية الأداء","التكامل مع الوثائق عبر الإنترنت","أمثلة من رمز سي++"]},"keywords":{"en":["cpp cheat sheet","how to use cpp","cpp vs c","cpp alternative to c++","cpp install guide","cpp setup for gpu programming","what is cpp","cpp development reference","cpp system level programming","cpp live examples"],"zh":["C/C++开发","AI智能工具","cppcheatsheet.com","GPU编程","系统级开发","C/C++参考大全","C/C++开发指南"],"ja":["C/C++プログラミング","AIエージェント","cppcheatsheet.com","GPUプログラミング","システムレベルの開発","C/C++リファレンス","C/C++プログラミングガイド"],"ko":["C/C++ 개발","AI 에이전트","cppcheatsheet.com","GPU 프로그래밍","시스템 레벨 개발","C/C++ 참조서","C/C++ 개발 가이드"],"es":["C/C++","desarrollo de C/C++","IA para C/C++","Herramientas de IA para C/C++","cppcheatsheet.com","programación de GPU","desarrollo a nivel de sistema"],"fr":["C/C++","développement C/C++","IA pour C/C++","Outils d''IA pour C/C++","cppcheatsheet.com","programmation GPU","développement au niveau du système"],"de":["C/C++","C/C++-Entwicklung","KI für C/C++","KI-Tools für C/C++","cppcheatsheet.com","GPU-Programmierung","Systementwicklung"],"pt":["C/C++","programação de GPU","desenvolvimento de sistema","cppcheatsheet","documentação local","exemplos de código","guias de configuração","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["C/C++","программирование GPU","системное развитие","cppcheatsheet","локальная документация","примеры кода","настройка","инструменты разработки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["سي++","برمجة gpu","التنمية النظمية","cppcheatsheet","الوثائق المحلية","أمثلة من رمز","دليل إعداد","أدوات التطوير","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"crazyguitar","repo":"cppcheatsheet","repoPath":"crazyguitar/cppcheatsheet","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.283Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cpp","description":"Comprehensive C/C++ programming reference covering everything from C11-C23 and C++11-C++23, system programming, CUDA GPU computing, debugging tools, Rust interop, and advanced topics. Use for: C/C++ questions, modern language features, RAII/memory management, templates/generics, CUDA programming, system programming, debugging/profiling, performance optimization, cross-platform development, build systems, assembly, shell scripting, and any C/C++/CUDA development tasks.","bodyPreview":"# C/C++ Comprehensive Cheat Sheets (/cpp)\n\nComplete C/C++ development reference combining local documentation with live examples from cppcheatsheet.com, covering everything from basic syntax to advanced GPU programming and system-level development.\n\n## How It Works\n\nWhen you ask C/C++ questions, I will:\n1. **Fetch live examples** from https://cppcheatsheet.com/\n2. **Enhance with local docs** if in the cppcheatsheet repository\n3. **Provide current, comprehensive answers** from the best available","body":"# C/C++ Comprehensive Cheat Sheets (/cpp)\n\nComplete C/C++ development reference combining local documentation with live examples from cppcheatsheet.com, covering everything from basic syntax to advanced GPU programming and system-level development.\n\n## How It Works\n\nWhen you ask C/C++ questions, I will:\n1. **Fetch live examples** from https://cppcheatsheet.com/\n2. **Enhance with local docs** if in the cppcheatsheet repository\n3. **Provide current, comprehensive answers** from the best available sources\n\n## Coverage Areas\n\n### Modern C Programming (C11-C23)\n**Core Language:** Syntax, types, memory management, preprocessor macros\n**GNU Extensions:** Compiler-specific features and optimizations\n**Build Systems:** Makefiles, compilation, linking\n**Assembly:** X86 assembly integration and inline assembly\n\n### Modern C++ Programming (C++11-C++23)\n**Core Features:** RAII, templates, STL containers, iterators, algorithms\n**Modern Standards:** Move semantics, constexpr, lambdas, concepts, coroutines, modules\n**Memory Management:** Smart pointers, resource management, optimization (RVO)\n**Build Systems:** CMake, package management, cross-platform builds\n\n### System Programming\n**Process Management:** POSIX processes, signals, process communication\n**File Systems:** File I/O, directory operations, filesystem monitoring\n**Networking:** Sockets, protocols, network programming patterns\n**Threading:** Multithreading, synchronization, parallel programming\n**IPC:** Inter-process communication, shared memory, message queues\n\n### CUDA Programming\n**GPU Computing:** CUDA kernels, memory hierarchy, performance optimization\n**Advanced CUDA:** libcu++, Thrust library, cooperative groups\n**Multi-GPU:** GPU-GPU communication, hardware topology, NVSHMEM\n**Async Programming:** CUDA pipelines, memory visibility, asynchronous execution\n\n### Debugging & Profiling\n**Debug Tools:** GDB debugging, Valgrind memory analysis, sanitizers, binary inspection (nm, readelf, objdump, otool)\n**Performance:** Perf profiling, tracing, performance optimization\n**GPU Debugging:** Nsight Systems, CUDA debugging and profiling\n\n### System Tools & Automation\n**Shell Scripting:** Bash programming, system administration\n**System Tools:** OS utilities, networking tools, hardware inspection\n**Service Management:** Systemd, process management, system monitoring\n\n### Cross-Language Development\n**Rust Interop:** Rust for C++ developers, FFI, memory safety comparison\n**Language Bridging:** C/C++ integration, foreign function interfaces\n\n### Advanced Topics\n**Blog Content:** Deep-dive articles, RDMA networking, GPU-initiated communication\n**Low-Level Programming:** Hardware interfaces, performance tuning\n**Architecture:** System design, scalable applications\n\n## References\n\nFor detailed information, I can access:\n- **[Structure](references/structure.md)** - Complete topic-to-URL reference map\n- **[Guidelines](references/guidelines.md)** - Code quality and best practices\n\n## Quick Examples\n\n### C/C++ Core\n- \"Modern C++23 features with examples\" → Latest language standards\n- \"RAII and smart pointer patterns\" → Memory management best practices\n- \"Template metaprogramming techniques\" → Advanced generic programming\n\n### System Programming\n- \"POSIX socket programming examples\" → Network programming patterns\n- \"Multithreading with std::thread and synchronization\" → Concurrent programming\n- \"Signal handling and process management\" → System-level programming\n\n### CUDA & GPU Programming\n- \"CUDA kernel optimization techniques\" → GPU performance programming\n- \"Multi-GPU communication with NVSHMEM\" → Distributed GPU computing\n- \"CUDA memory hierarchy and optimization\" → Memory-efficient GPU code\n\n### Debugging & Tools\n- \"GDB debugging C++ applications\" → Interactive debugging techniques\n- \"Valgrind memory leak detection\" → Memory analysis and debugging\n- \"Performance profiling with perf\" → System performance analysis\n\n### Build & Development\n- \"CMake cross-platform build systems\" → Modern C++ project setup\n- \"Makefile patterns and best practices\" → C build automation\n- \"Cross-compilation and toolchain setup\" → Multi-platform development"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:54.557Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Analysis Agents requiring in-depth C/C++ syntax guidance and development insights.","zh":"适用于需要深入C/C++语法指导和开发见解的代码分析代理。","ja":"C/C++の構文ガイドと開発洞察が必要なコード分析エージェントに適しています。","ko":"코드 분석 에이전트가 C/C++ 구문 지침 및 개발 통찰력이 필요할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Código que requieren orientación detallada sobre la sintaxis de C/C++ y conocimientos de desarrollo.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code nécessitant une guidance approfondie sur la syntaxe C/C++ et des informations de développement.","de":"Ideal für Code-Analyse-Agents, die detaillierte Anleitung zur C/C++-Syntax und Entwicklungseinblicke benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Código que exigem orientação sintática aprofundada em C/C++ e insights de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, требующих глубокого руководства по синтаксису C/C++ и информации о разработке.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يتطلب إرشادات متعمقة لتنسيق C/C++ واطلاعات حول التطوير."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to provide comprehensive C/C++ development references, combining local documentation with live examples from cppcheatsheet.com, covering basic syntax, advanced GPU programming, and system-level development using libraries and protocols.","zh":"赋予代理提供全面的C/C++开发参考，结合本地文档和cppcheatsheet.com的实时示例，涵盖基本语法、高级GPU编程和使用库和协议的系统级开发。","ja":"エージェントがcppcheatsheet.comからのライブ例とローカルドキュメントを組み合わせた包括的なC/C++開発リファレンスを提供できるようにし、基本構文、先進的なGPUプログラミング、ライブラリとプロトコルを使用したシステムレベルの開発をカバーします。","ko":"cppcheatsheet.com의 라이브 예제와 로컬 문서를 결합하여 포괄적인 C/C++ 개발 참조를 제공할 수 있도록 에이전트를 활성화하여 기본 구문, 고급 GPU 프로그래밍 및 라이브러리 및 프로토콜을 사용한 시스템 수준 개발을 다룹니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes proporcionar referencias de desarrollo de C/C++ completas, combinando la documentación local con ejemplos en vivo de cppcheatsheet.com, cubriendo la sintaxis básica, la programación de GPU avanzada y el desarrollo a nivel de sistema utilizando bibliotecas y protocolos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de fournir des références de développement C/C++ complètes, combinant la documentation locale avec des exemples en direct de cppcheatsheet.com, couvrant la syntaxe de base, la programmation GPU avancée et le développement au niveau du système en utilisant des bibliothèques et des protocoles.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, umfassende C/C++-Entwicklungsreferenzen bereitzustellen, indem lokale Dokumentation mit Live-Beispielen von cppcheatsheet.com kombiniert wird, wobei die grundlegende Syntax, die erweiterte GPU-Programmierung und die systemweite Entwicklung unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken und Protokollen abgedeckt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fornecer referências abrangentes de desenvolvimento C/C++, combinando documentação local com exemplos ao vivo do cppcheatsheet.com, cobrindo sintaxe básica, programação de GPU avançada e desenvolvimento de nível de sistema usando bibliotecas e protocolos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам предоставлять полные справочные материалы по разработке на C/C++, сочетая локальную документацию с живыми примерами с cppcheatsheet.com, охватывающими базовый синтаксис, продвинутую программирование GPU и системное развитие с использованием библиотек и протоколов.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توفير مراجع شاملة لتطوير C/C++ ، kết hợp الوثائق المحلية مع الأمثلة الحية من cppcheatsheet.com ، وتغطية التنسيق الأساسي وتقدم برمجة GPU والتنمية على مستوى النظام باستخدام المكتبات والبروتوكولات."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging C/C++ code snippets","Generating GPU programming examples","Providing system-level development guidance"],"zh":["调试C/C++代码片段","生成GPU编程示例","提供系统级开发指南"],"ja":["C/C++コードスニペットのデバッグ","GPUプログラミングの例の生成","システムレベルの開発ガイダンスの提供"],"ko":["C/C++ 코드 스니펫 디버깅","GPU 프로그래밍 예제 생성","시스템 수준 개발 가이드 제공"],"es":["Depuración de fragmentos de código C/C++","Generación de ejemplos de programación de GPU","Proporcionar orientación sobre el desarrollo a nivel de sistema"],"fr":["Débogage de fragments de code C/C++","Génération d''exemples de programmation GPU","Fournir des conseils sur le développement au niveau du système"],"de":["Debuggen von C/C++-Code-Snippets","Erzeugen von GPU-Programmierbeispielen","Bereitstellen von Anleitung zur systemweiten Entwicklung"],"pt":["Depuração de trechos de código C/C++","Geração de exemplos de programação de GPU","Fornecimento de orientação de desenvolvimento de nível de sistema"],"ru":["Отладка фрагментов кода C/C++","Генерация примеров программирования GPU","Предоставление рекомендаций по системному развитию"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء مقاطع الشفرة C/C++","توليد أمثلة برمجة GPU","توفير إرشادات التطوير على مستوى النظام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to cppcheatsheet.com for live examples","Limited to C/C++ development reference"],"zh":["需要访问cppcheatsheet.com以获取实时示例","仅限C/C++开发参考"],"ja":["ライブ例を取得するためにcppcheatsheet.comへのアクセスが必要","C/C++開発リファレンスのみ"],"ko":["라이브 예제를 가져오기 위해 cppcheatsheet.com에 접근해야 함","C