INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('rolldown/rolldown/upgrade-oxc', 'upgrade-oxc', 'rolldown', 'rolldown', 'community', 'upgrade-oxc rolldown rolldown community The upgrade-oxc skill provides a fast Rust bundler for JavaScript/TypeScript with a Rollup-compatible API, benefiting developers who need efficient project setup and management. Upgrade OXC 是一个快速的 Rust 打包工具，支持 Rollup 兼容 API，用于 JavaScript/TypeScript 项目构建 Upgrade OXC は、Rollup 互換 API を備えた JavaScript/TypeScript プロジェクトを高速に構築するための、高速な Rust バンドルツールです Upgrade OXC는 Rollup 호환 API를 갖춘 JavaScript/TypeScript 프로젝트를 빠르게 구축하는 빠른 Rust 번들링 도구입니다 Upgrade-oxc es un empaquetador de Rust rápido para JavaScript/TypeScript con API compatible con Rollup. Sigue los pasos para configurarlo correctamente Upgrade-oxc est un bundleur Rust rapide pour JavaScript/TypeScript avec API compatible Rollup. Suivez les étapes pour le configurer correctement Upgrade-oxc ist ein schneller Rust-Bundler für JavaScript/TypeScript mit Rollup-kompatibler API. Befolgen Sie die Schritte für eine korrekte Konfiguration O Upgrade OXC é uma ferramenta de bundling Rust para JavaScript/TypeScript que oferece uma API compatível com Rollup. Siga os passos para configurá-la corretamente Upgrade OXC - это инструмент для сборки Rust для JavaScript/TypeScript, предлагающий API, совместимый с Rollup. Следуйте инструкциям для правильной настройки Upgrade OXC هو أداة Bundling Rust لجافا سكريبت/طيب سكريبت التي توفر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Rollup. اتبع الإرشادات لتهيئته بشكل صحيح how to use upgrade-oxc upgrade-oxc setup guide upgrade-oxc alternative upgrade-oxc vs rollup upgrade-oxc install what is upgrade-oxc upgrade-oxc for JavaScript developers upgrade-oxc for TypeScript projects fast Rust bundler Rollup-compatible API Upgrade OXC Rust 打包工具 Rollup 兼容 API JavaScript/TypeScript 项目构建 快速构建 依赖包管理 AI 工具 AIエージェント Runs sequential setup commands with dependencies, including `git checkout` and `just setup` Updates `pnpm-workspace.yaml` file with the latest versions of `@oxc-project/runtime`, `@oxc-project/types`, and other dependencies Utilizes `npm view` command to note the version of `@oxc-project/types` Supports Rollup-compatible API for flexible and efficient bundling Executes commands sequentially with `git pull` and `just setup` for reliable project setup upgrade-oxc is a fast Rust bundler for JavaScript/TypeScript projects, utilizing a Rollup-compatible API for seamless integration and efficient development.');
