is a technical reference skill for DataFusion, PyArrow, and DeltaLake APIs, providing operating rules and guidelines for efficient development.","zh":"dfdl_ref 是一个用于 DataFusion 和 DeltaLake 的 AI 代理，提供数据处理和 API 调用的技术支持","ja":"dfdl_ref は、DataFusion と DeltaLake 用の AI エージェントであり、データ処理と API 呼び出しの技術サポートを提供します","ko":"dfdl_ref는 DataFusion 및 DeltaLake용 AI 에이전트로, 데이터 처리 및 API 호출의 기술 지원을 제공합니다","es":"dfdl_ref es una habilidad que proporciona referencias y patrones para el desarrollo con DataFusion, DeltaLake y PyArrow","fr":"dfdl_ref est une compétence qui fournit des références et des modèles pour le développement avec DataFusion, DeltaLake et PyArrow","de":"dfdl_ref ist eine Fähigkeit, die Referenzen und Muster für die Entwicklung mit DataFusion, DeltaLake und PyArrow bereitstellt","pt":"Dfdl_ref é um guia técnico para configuração de DataFusion e DeltaLake.","ru":"Dfdl_ref - это техническое руководство по настройке DataFusion и DeltaLake с ИИ Агентами.","ar":"dfdl_ref هو مرجع تقني لتحديث DataFusion و DeltaLake مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"features":{"en":["Provides reference maps for Core DataFusion Python surfaces (IO, catalog, SQL, DataFrame API)","Includes guidelines for probing local environments and searching repositories for existing API usage","Offers best-in-class deployment strategies for DataFusion and DeltaLake","Supports implementation using existing local patterns for PyArrow and UDF APIs","Features a comprehensive reference file (reference/datafusion.md) for DataFusion API details"],"zh":["支持 DataFusion 和 DeltaLake 的核心 Python 接口","提供数据处理和 API 调用的最佳实践","包含 reference/datafusion.md 和其他相关文档","支持 PyArrow 和 UDF APIs","提供实现使用现有本地模式的方法","支持搜索本地环境和仓库的方法"],"ja":["DataFusion と DeltaLake のコア Python インターフェイスをサポート","データ処理と API 呼び出しのベストプラクティスを提供","reference/datafusion.md やその他の関連ドキュメントを含む","PyArrow と UDF APIs をサポート","既存のローカルパターンを使用した実装方法を提供","ローカル環境とリポジトリの検索方法をサポート"],"ko":["DataFusion 및 DeltaLake의核心 Python 인터페이스를 지원","데이터 처리 및 API 호출의 최적화된 방법을 제공","reference/datafusion.md 및 기타 관련 문서를 포함","PyArrow 및 UDF APIs를 지원","기존 로컬 패턴을 사용한 구현 방법을 제공","로컬 환경 및 리포지토리의 검색 방법을 지원"],"es":["Referencias para DataFusion y DeltaLake","Patrones de desarrollo para PyArrow","Guía para la configuración de dfdl_ref","Mejores prácticas para el desarrollo con DataFusion","Integración con DataFusion y DeltaLake"],"fr":["Références pour DataFusion et DeltaLake","Modèles de développement pour PyArrow","Guide pour la configuration de dfdl_ref","Meilleures pratiques pour le développement avec DataFusion","Intégration avec DataFusion et DeltaLake"],"de":["Referenzen für DataFusion und DeltaLake","Entwicklungsmodelle für PyArrow","Leitfaden für die Einrichtung von dfdl_ref","Beste Praktiken für die Entwicklung mit DataFusion","Integration mit DataFusion und DeltaLake"],"pt":["Uso de APIs de DataFusion e DeltaLake","Integração com PyArrow","Melhores práticas para uso de APIs","Referência para configuração de DataFusion e DeltaLake","Uso de padrões locais existentes"],"ru":["Использование API DataFusion и DeltaLake","Интеграция с PyArrow","Лучшие практики для использования API с ИИ Агентами","Справочник для настройки DataFusion и DeltaLake","Использование существующих местных шаблонов"],"ar":["استخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات ل DataFusion و DeltaLake","التكامل مع PyArrow","أفضل الممارسات لاستخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مرجع لتحديث DataFusion و DeltaLake","استخدام الأنماط المحلية الحالية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use dfdl_ref","dfdl_ref vs DataFusion","dfdl_ref setup guide","what is dfdl_ref","dfdl_ref alternative to PyArrow","DataFusion API reference","DeltaLake API guide","PyArrow API tutorial","dfdl_ref install","dfdl_ref documentation"],"zh":["dfdl_ref","DataFusion","DeltaLake","PyArrow","UDF APIs","Python","AI 代理","数据处理","API 调用","最佳实践"],"ja":["dfdl_ref","DataFusion","DeltaLake","PyArrow","UDF APIs","Python","AI エージェント","データ処理","API 呼び出し","ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["dfdl_ref","DataFusion","DeltaLake","PyArrow","UDF APIs","Python","AI 에이전트","데이터 처리","API 호출","최적화된 방법"],"es":["dfdl_ref","DataFusion","DeltaLake","PyArrow","desarrollo de software","configuración de dfdl_ref","mejores prácticas de desarrollo","herramientas de desarrollo","AI Agentes"],"fr":["dfdl_ref","DataFusion","DeltaLake","PyArrow","développement de logiciels","configuration de dfdl_ref","meilleures pratiques de développement","outils de développement","Outils d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["dfdl_ref","DataFusion","DeltaLake","PyArrow","Softwareentwicklung","Einrichtung von dfdl_ref","beste Praktiken für die Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Künstliche Intelligenz Tools"],"pt":["dfdl_ref","DataFusion","DeltaLake","PyArrow","APIs","melhores práticas","configuração","desenvolvimento","DataFusion tutorial","DeltaLake guia"],"ru":["dfdl_ref","DataFusion","DeltaLake","PyArrow","API","лучшие практики","настройка","разработка","DataFusion руководство","DeltaLake справочник","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["dfdl_ref","DataFusion","DeltaLake","PyArrow","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","أفضل الممارسات","إعداد","تنمية","DataFusion دليل","DeltaLake مرجع","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"paul-heyse","repo":"CodeAnatomy","repoPath":"paul-heyse/CodeAnatomy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.300Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dfdl_ref","description":"DataFusion + DeltaLake operations manual for this repo. DataFusion is the core query engine; DeltaLake provides the storage layer and integrates tightly via scan providers, schema bridging, and predicate pushdown. Use lookup + local probes; do not guess APIs.","bodyPreview":"## Operating rule: never guess DataFusion/DeltaLake/PyArrow/UDF APIs\nWhen uncertain:\n1) Probe local environment (versions + available methods).\n2) Search the repo for how we already use it.\n3) Open the relevant reference file below (only the section you need).\n4) Implement using *existing local patterns* unless the plan says otherwise.\n\n\n## Reference map (open these files as needed)\n- Core DataFusion Python surfaces (IO, catalog, SQL, DataFrame API): reference/datafusion.md\n- \"Best-in-class depl","body":"## Operating rule: never guess DataFusion/DeltaLake/PyArrow/UDF APIs\nWhen uncertain:\n1) Probe local environment (versions + available methods).\n2) Search the repo for how we already use it.\n3) Open the relevant reference file below (only the section you need).\n4) Implement using *existing local patterns* unless the plan says otherwise.\n\n\n## Reference map (open these files as needed)\n- Core DataFusion Python surfaces (IO, catalog, SQL, DataFrame API): reference/datafusion.md\n- \"Best-in-class deployment gaps\" (caching, stats, observability, planning knobs): reference/datafusion_addendum.md\n- Planning deep dive (logical/physical plan pipeline, introspection, optimization rules): reference/datafusion_planning.md\n- Rust UDF contracts (Scalar/UDAF/UDWF/Async/named args): reference/datafusion_rust_UDFs.md\n- Schema management + schema pitfalls: reference/datafusion_schema.md\n- DeltaLake ↔ DataFusion integration details: reference/deltalake_datafusion_integration.md\n- Advanced Rust integration (PyO3 packaging, wheels, CI, native module distribution): reference/datafusion_deltalake_advanced_rust_integration.md\n- DataFusionMixins trait (Delta snapshot schema + predicate parsing helpers): reference/deltalake_datafusionmixins.md\n- Plan combination (composing DataFusion plans via joins/unions/CTEs, Delta integration, parameterized queries, plan serialization): reference/datafusion_plan_combination.md\n- Rust LogicalPlan programmatic construction (LogicalPlanBuilder, Expr, schema/DFSchema, plan rewriting via TreeNode, extensibility, serialization): reference/Datafusion_logicplan_rust.md\n- DataFusion tracing (Rust community extension: execution spans, metrics capture, partial-result previews, rule-phase instrumentation, OpenTelemetry export): reference/datafusion-tracing.md\n- DeltaLake core (format/protocol, client APIs, 3-layer model): reference/deltalake.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:27.793Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing comprehensive references for DataFusion, DeltaLake, and PyArrow APIs","zh":"非常适合需要对 DataFusion、DeltaLake 和 PyArrow APIs 有全面参考的数据分析代理","ja":"DataFusion、DeltaLake、PyArrow API に対する包括的なリファレンスが必要なデータ分析エージェントに最適","ko":"DataFusion, DeltaLake, PyArrow API에 대한 포괄적인 참조가 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan referencias completas para DataFusion, DeltaLake y APIs de PyArrow","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Données ayant besoin de références complètes pour DataFusion, DeltaLake et les API de PyArrow","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die umfassende Referenzen für DataFusion, DeltaLake und PyArrow-APIs benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que precisam de referências abrangentes para DataFusion, DeltaLake e APIs PyArrow","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым необходимы полные справочные материалы для DataFusion, DeltaLake и API PyArrow","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى مرجع شامل لبروتوكول DataFusion و DeltaLake و PyArrow"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently develop with DataFusion, DeltaLake, and PyArrow by providing guidelines and references for their APIs, including Core DataFusion Python surfaces and best-in-class deployment patterns, ensuring accurate and reliable interactions with these technologies","zh":"通过为 DataFusion、DeltaLake 和 PyArrow 提供指南和 API 参考，包括核心 DataFusion Python 接口和最优的部署模式，确保与这些技术的交互准确可靠，从而使代理能够高效地开发","ja":"DataFusion、DeltaLake、PyArrow に対するガイドと API リファレンスを提供し、Core DataFusion Python インターフェイスや最適なデプロイパターンを含むことで、これらのテクノロジーとのやり取りを正確かつ信頼性高く保ち、エージェントが効率的に開発できるようにする","ko":"DataFusion, DeltaLake, PyArrow에 대한 가이드와 API 참조를 제공함으로써, 핵심 DataFusion Python 인터페이스 및 최적의 배포 패턴을 포함하여 이 기술들 간의 상호 작용이 정확하고 신뢰할 수 있도록 하여, 에이전트가 효율적으로 개발할 수 있도록 하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar de manera eficiente con DataFusion, DeltaLake y PyArrow, proporcionando pautas y referencias para sus APIs, incluyendo superficies de Python de Core DataFusion y patrones de implementación de clase mundial, garantizando interacciones precisas y confiables con estas tecnologías","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer de manière efficace avec DataFusion, DeltaLake et PyArrow en fournissant des lignes directrices et des références pour leurs API, y compris les surfaces Python de Core DataFusion et les modèles de déploiement de classe mondiale, garantissant des interactions précises et fiables avec ces technologies","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, effizient mit DataFusion, DeltaLake und PyArrow zu entwickeln, indem es Richtlinien und Referenzen für ihre APIs bereitstellt, einschließlich Core DataFusion Python-Oberflächen und erstklassiger Bereitstellungsmodelle, um genaue und zuverlässige Interaktionen mit diesen Technologien sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver de forma eficiente com DataFusion, DeltaLake e PyArrow, fornecendo diretrizes e referências para suas APIs, incluindo superfícies Python Core DataFusion e padrões de implantação de classe mundial, garantindo interações precisas e confiáveis com essas tecnologias","ru":"Позволяет агентам эффективно разрабатывать с помощью DataFusion, DeltaLake и PyArrow, предоставляя руководство и справочные материалы для их API, включая поверхности Python Core DataFusion и лучшие в классе модели развертывания, обеспечивая точное и надежное взаимодействие с этими технологиями","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تطوير تطبيقاتهم بشكل فعال باستخدام DataFusion و DeltaLake و PyArrow من خلال توفير الإرشادات والمراجع لبروتوكولهم، بما في ذلك سطوح Python Core DataFusion وأفضل أنماط النشر، مما يضمن تفاعلات دقيقة وموثوقة مع هذه التكنولوجيا"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging DataFusion and DeltaLake integrations","Optimizing PyArrow data processing workflows","Implementing efficient DataFusion and DeltaLake APIs using existing local patterns"],"zh":["调试 DataFusion 和 DeltaLake 集成","优化 PyArrow 数据处理工作流","使用现有的本地模式实现高效的 DataFusion 和 DeltaLake API"],"ja":["DataFusion と DeltaLake の統合をデバッグする","PyArrow データ処理ワークフローを最適化する","既存のローカルパターンを使用して高効率の DataFusion と DeltaLake API を実装する"],"ko":["DataFusion 및 DeltaLake 통합 디버깅","PyArrow 데이터 처리 워크플로 최적화","기존 로컬 패턴을 사용하여 효율적인 DataFusion 및 DeltaLake API 구현"],"es":["Depuración de integraciones de DataFusion y DeltaLake","Optimización de flujos de procesamiento de datos de PyArrow","Implementación de APIs de DataFusion y DeltaLake eficientes utilizando patrones locales existentes"],"fr":["Débogage des intégrations DataFusion et DeltaLake","Optimisation des flux de traitement de données de PyArrow","Mise en œuvre d''API de DataFusion et DeltaLake efficaces en utilisant des modèles locaux existants"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei DataFusion- und DeltaLake-Integrationen","Optimierung von PyArrow-Datenaufbereitungsworkflows","Implementierung effizienter DataFusion- und DeltaLake-APIs unter Verwendung vorhandener lokaler Muster"],"pt":["Depuração de integrações DataFusion e DeltaLake","Otimização de fluxos de processamento de dados PyArrow","Implementação de APIs DataFusion e DeltaLake eficientes usando padrões locais existentes"],"ru":["Отладка интеграций DataFusion и DeltaLake","Оптимизация потоков обработки данных PyArrow","Реализация эффективных API DataFusion и DeltaLake с использованием существующих местных моделей"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء التكامل بين DataFusion و DeltaLake","تحسين تدفقات معالجة البيانات PyArrow","تنفيذ واجهات برمجة تطبيقات DataFusion و DeltaLake الفعالة باستخدام الأنماط المحلية الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to local environment for version and method probing","Limited to DataFusion, DeltaLake, and PyArrow APIs"],"zh":["需要访问本地环境以进行版本和方法探测","仅限 DataFusion、DeltaLake 和 PyArrow APIs"],"ja":["バージョンとメソッドのプローブを行うためにローカル環境へのアクセスが必要","DataFusion、DeltaLake、PyArrow API 限定"],"ko":["버전 및 메소드 프로브를 위해 로컬 환경에 대한 액세스가 필요","DataFusion, DeltaLake, PyArrow API만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso al 