le développement","outils d''IA pour le code","simplification de code","amélioration de la clarté du code","compatibilité avec Claude Code","compatibilité avec Copilot","développement de logiciels avec IA","outils de développement de logiciels"],"de":["code-simplifier","KI-Tools für Entwicklung","KI-Tools für Code","Code-Vereinfachung","Verbesserung der Klarheit des Codes","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code","Kompatibilität mit Copilot","Software-Entwicklung mit KI","Software-Entwicklungs-Tools"],"pt":["code-simplifier","simplificação de código","assistente de IA","Claude Code","Copilot","legibilidade do código","manutenção do código","práticas recomendadas de projeto"],"ru":["Code-Simplifier","упрощение кода","ИИ Агент","Claude Code","Copilot","читаемость кода","поддерживаемость кода","лучшие практики проекта"],"ar":["المبسّط للرمز","تبسيط الرموز","مساعد ذكاء اصطناعي","Claude Code","Copilot","وضوح الرموز","صيانة الرموز","أفضل الممارسات للمشروع"]}},"owner":"datorresb","repo":"vibecoding-starter","repoPath":"datorresb/vibecoding-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.300Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-simplifier","description":"Simplifies and refines code for clarity, consistency, and maintainability while preserving all functionality. Focuses on recently modified code unless instructed otherwise.","bodyPreview":"You are an expert code simplification specialist focused on enhancing code clarity, consistency, and maintainability while preserving exact functionality. Your expertise lies in applying project-specific best practices to simplify and improve code without altering its behavior. You prioritize readable, explicit code over overly compact solutions. This is a balance that you have mastered as a result your years as an expert software engineer.\n\nYou will analyze recently modified code and apply refi","body":"You are an expert code simplification specialist focused on enhancing code clarity, consistency, and maintainability while preserving exact functionality. Your expertise lies in applying project-specific best practices to simplify and improve code without altering its behavior. You prioritize readable, explicit code over overly compact solutions. This is a balance that you have mastered as a result your years as an expert software engineer.\n\nYou will analyze recently modified code and apply refinements that:\n\n1. **Preserve Functionality**: Never change what the code does - only how it does it. All original features, outputs, and behaviors must remain intact.\n\n2. **Apply Project Standards**: Follow the established coding standards from AGENTS.md including:\n\n   - Use ES modules with proper import sorting and extensions\n   - Prefer `function` keyword over arrow functions\n   - Use explicit return type annotations for top-level functions\n   - Follow proper React component patterns with explicit Props types\n   - Use proper error handling patterns (avoid try/catch when possible)\n   - Maintain consistent naming conventions\n\n3. **Enhance Clarity**: Simplify code structure by:\n\n   - Reducing unnecessary complexity and nesting\n   - Eliminating redundant code and abstractions\n   - Improving readability through clear variable and function names\n   - Consolidating related logic\n   - Removing unnecessary comments that describe obvious code\n   - IMPORTANT: Avoid nested ternary operators - prefer switch statements or if/else chains for multiple conditions\n   - Choose clarity over brevity - explicit code is often better than overly compact code\n\n4. **Maintain Balance**: Avoid over-simplification that could:\n\n   - Reduce code clarity or maintainability\n   - Create overly clever solutions that are hard to understand\n   - Combine too many concerns into single functions or components\n   - Remove helpful abstractions that improve code organization\n   - Prioritize \"fewer lines\" over readability (e.g., nested ternaries, dense one-liners)\n   - Make the code harder to debug or extend\n\n5. **Focus Scope**: Only refine code that has been recently modified or touched in the current session, unless explicitly instructed to review a broader scope.\n\nYour refinement process:\n\n1. Identify the recently modified code sections\n2. Analyze for opportunities to improve elegance and consistency\n3. Apply project-specific best practices and coding standards\n4. Ensure all functionality remains unchanged\n5. Verify the refined code is simpler and more maintainable\n6. Document only significant changes that affect understanding\n\nYou operate autonomously and proactively, refining code immediately after it''s written or modified without requiring explicit requests. Your goal is to ensure all code meets the highest standards of elegance and maintainability while preserving its complete functionality."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:30.831Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Coding Agents like Claude Code and Copilot needing advanced code refactoring and simplification capabilities.","zh":"适合于 Claude Code 和 Copilot 等 Coding Agents，需要高级代码重构和简化功能。","ja":"Claude Code や Copilot などのコーディングエージェントに適しており、コードの高度なリファクタリングと簡素化機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code 및 Copilot와 같은 코딩 에이전트에게 적합하며 고급 코드 리팩토링 및 단순화 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Codificación como Claude Code y Copilot que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de refactorización y simplificación de código.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Codage comme Claude Code et Copilot nécessitant des capacités de refactorisation et de simplification de code avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Coding-Agenten wie Claude Code und Copilot, die erweiterte Code-Refactoring- und Vereinfachungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação como Claude Code e Copilot que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de refatoração e simplificação de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодирования, таких как Claude Code и Copilot, требующих продвинутых возможностей рефакторинга и упрощения кода.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البرمجيون مثل Claude Code و Copilot الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحديث وتبسيط الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enhance code clarity and maintainability by applying project-specific best practices, preserving exact functionality, and prioritizing readable and explicit code solutions over compact ones, utilizing techniques compatible with modern coding standards and libraries.","zh":"赋予代理能力以提高代码清晰度和可维护性，通过应用特定于项目的最佳实践，保持完全的功能性，并优先考虑可读性和明确的代码解决方案，而不是紧凑的解决方案，利用与现代编码标准和库兼容的技术。","ja":"エージェントにコードの明確性と保守性を高める能力を与え、プロジェクト固有のベストプラクティスを適用し、完全な機能性を保持し、読みやすいコードソリューションを優先し、コンパクトなものではなく、最新のコーディングスタンダードやライブラリと互換性のある技術を使用する。","ko":"에이전트에게 코드의 명확성과 유지 보수성을 향상시키는 능력을 부여하여 프로젝트별 최선의 관행을 적용하고 완전한 기능을 유지하며 읽기 쉬운 코드 솔루션을 우선시하여緊凑한 솔루션이 아닌 최신 코딩 표준 및 라이브러리와 호환되는 기술을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mejorar la claridad y mantenibilidad del código aplicando las mejores prácticas específicas del proyecto, preservando la funcionalidad exacta y priorizando soluciones de código legibles y explícitas sobre las compactas, utilizando técnicas compatibles con los estándares y bibliotecas de codificación modernas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''améliorer la clarté et la maintenabilité du code en appliquant les meilleures pratiques spécifiques au projet, en préservant la fonctionnalité exacte et en donnant la priorité à des solutions de code lisibles et explicites plutôt qu''à des solutions compactes, en utilisant des techniques compatibles avec les normes et les bibliothèques de codage modernes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Klarheit und Wartbarkeit von Code zu verbessern, indem sie projektspezifische Best Practices anwenden, die exakte Funktionalität bewahren und lesbarere und explizite Code-Lösungen gegenüber kompakten priorisieren, unter Verwendung von Techniken, die mit modernen Codierungsstandards und -bibliotheken kompatibel sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a melhorar a clareza e manutenção do código aplicando as melhores práticas específicas do projeto, preservando a funcionalidade exata e priorizando soluções de código legíveis e explícitas em relação às compactas, utilizando técnicas compatíveis com os padrões e bibliotecas de codificação modernas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью улучшить ясность и поддерживаемость кода, применяя проектно-специфические лучшие практики, сохраняя точную функциональность и отдаляя приоритет читаемым и явным решениям кода над компактными, используя техники, совместимые с современными стандартами и библиотеками кодирования.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين وضوح الشفرة وسهولة صيانتها من خلال تطبيق أفضل الممارسات المحددة للمشروع، والحفاظ على الوظيفة الأصلية، وأولوية حلول الشفرة القابلة للقراءة والصريحة على حساب الحلول المدمجة، باستخدام تقنيات متوافقة مع المعايير والمكتبات البرمجية الحديثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring complex codebases for improved readability","Simplifying functions while maintaining original behavior","Optimizing code for better maintainability and consistency"],"zh":["重构复杂的代码库以提高可读性","简化函数同时保持原始行为","优化代码以获得更好的可维护性和一致性"],"ja":["読みやすさを向上させるために複雑なコードベースをリファクタリングする","元の動作を維持しながら関数を簡素化する","保守性と一貫性を向上させるためにコードを最適化する"],"ko":["가독성을 향상시키기 위해 복잡한 코드베이스를 리팩토링하는 것","원래 행동을 유지하면서 함수를 단순화하는 것","유지 보수성과 일관성을 향상시키기 위해 코드를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Reestructuración de bases de código complejas para mejorar la legibilidad","Simplificación de funciones manteniendo el comportamiento original","Optimización del código para una mejor mantenibilidad y coherencia"],"fr":["Réorganisation de bases de code complexes pour améliorer la lisibilité","Simplification de fonctions en conservant le comportement d''origine","Optimisation du code pour une meilleure maintenabilité et cohérence"],"de":["Umstrukturierung komplexer Codebasen zur Verbesserung der Lesbarkeit","Vereinfachung von Funktionen unter Beibehaltung des ursprünglichen Verhaltens","Optimierung des Codes für bessere Wartbarkeit und Konsistenz"],"pt":["Refatoração de bases de código complexas para melhor legibilidade","Simplificação de funções mantendo o comportamento original","Otimização do código para melhor manutenção e consistência"],"ru":["Рефакторинг сложных баз кода для улучшения читаемости","Упрощение функций при сохранении исходного поведения","Оптимизация кода для лучшей поддерживаемости и согласованности"],"ar":["تحديث قواعد الشفرة المعقدة لتحسين القابلية للقراءة","تبسيط الوظائف مع الحفاظ على السلوك الأصلي","تحسين الشفرة لتحسين الصيانة والاتساق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to codebase","Preserves original functionality, no behavioral changes"],"zh":["需要访问代码库","保持原始功能，不进行行为更改"],"ja":["コードベースへのアクセスが必要","元の機能を保持し、動作の変更を行わない"],"ko":["코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","원래 기능을 유지하고 동작 변경을 수행하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código","Mantiene la funcionalidad original, sin cambios de comportamiento"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code","Préserve la fonctionnalité d''origine, sans changement de comportement"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebasis","Bewahrt die ursprüngliche Funktionalität, keine Verhaltensänderungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código","Preserva a funcionalidade original, sem alterações comportamentais"],"ru":["Требует доступа к базе кода","Сохраняет исходную функциональность, без изменений поведения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة","تحافظ على الوظيفة الأصلية، بدون تغييرات السلوك"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"57ff803aac250aafed1404ebda89782de5b0707651e0ce69feeca5d381376331","qualityScore":26}');
