th glassmorphic design","zh":"Watch 连接性集成是一种使用 SwiftUI 和 HealthKit 的 iOS 应用程序，用于间歇性禁食跟踪","ja":"Watch 接続性は、SwiftUI と HealthKit を使用した iOS 間歇性禁食トラッカー アプリの一種","ko":"ウォッチ 커넥ティビティ는 SwiftUI 및 HealthKit를 사용한 iOS 간歇적 금식 트래커 앱의 일종","es":"watch-connectivity es una habilidad que permite la integración de aplicaciones de iOS con relojes inteligentes para el seguimiento de la salud","fr":"watch-connectivity est une compétence qui permet l''intégration d''applications iOS avec des montres intelligentes pour le suivi de la santé","de":"watch-connectivity ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Integration von iOS-Apps mit Smartwatches für die Gesundheitsüberwachung ermöglicht","pt":"Watch-connectivity é uma habilidade que habilita a conexão entre dispositivos iOS e Apple Watch","ru":"Watch-connectivity - это навык, который обеспечивает подключение между устройствами iOS и Apple Watch","ar":"الاتصال الساعي هو قدرة تمكن من الاتصال بين أجهزة آي أو إس وساعة آبل"},"features":{"en":["Generates Message schema with keys, payload types, and versioning","Provides iOS WCSession manager and watch WCSession manager skeletons","Includes failure handling strategy for not reachable and delays","Supports minimal tests for encoding and decoding","Integrates with HealthKit for health and wellness data","Utilizes SwiftUI for building user interfaces"],"zh":["SwiftUI 集成","HealthKit 数据跟踪","玻璃形设计","WCSession 管理器","消息模式和负载类型","故障处理策略"],"ja":["SwiftUI 統合","HealthKit データ トラッキング","ガラスモルフィック デザイン","WCSession マネージャー","メッセージ スキーマとペイロード タイプ","障害処理戦略"],"ko":["SwiftUI 통합","HealthKit 데이터 추적","유리 모르픽 디자인","WCSession 관리자","메시지 스키마 및 페이로드 유형","장애 처리 전략"],"es":["Integración con HealthKit para el seguimiento de la salud","Diseño glassmorphic para una experiencia de usuario óptima","Compatibilidad con SwiftUI para el desarrollo de aplicaciones","Funcionalidades de seguimiento de ayuno intermitente","Gestión de sesiones de watch-connectivity para una conexión estable","Manejo de errores y retrasos en la conexión"],"fr":["Intégration avec HealthKit pour le suivi de la santé","Conception glassmorphic pour une expérience utilisateur optimale","Compatibilité avec SwiftUI pour le développement d''applications","Fonctionnalités de suivi du jeûne intermittent","Gestion des sessions de watch-connectivity pour une connexion stable","Gestion des erreurs et des retards de connexion"],"de":["Integration mit HealthKit für die Gesundheitsüberwachung","Glassmorphic-Design für eine optimale Benutzererfahrung","Kompatibilität mit SwiftUI für die App-Entwicklung","Funktionen zur Überwachung des intermittierenden Fastens","Verwaltung von watch-connectivity-Sitzungen für eine stabile Verbindung","Fehler- und Verzögerungsbehandlung bei der Verbindung"],"pt":["Integração com HealthKit","Desenvolvimento com SwiftUI","Design glassmorphic","Gerenciamento de sessão WCSession","Tratamento de falhas e atrasos","Testes mínimos para codificação e decodificação"],"ru":["Интеграция с HealthKit","Разработка с помощью SwiftUI","Стекломорфный дизайн","Управление сессией WCSession","Обработка ошибок и задержек","Минимальные тесты для кодирования и декодирования"],"ar":["دمج HealthKit","التطوير باستخدام SwiftUI","تصميم زجاجي مورفي","إدارة جلسة WCSession","معالجة الأخطاء والتأخيرات","اختبارات دقيقة لترميز وفك الترميز"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use watch-connectivity","watch-connectivity setup guide","watch-connectivity and HealthKit integration","watch-connectivity vs Core Bluetooth","watch-connectivity install","what is watch-connectivity","watch-connectivity alternative","watch-connectivity and SwiftUI tutorial","watch-connectivity failure handling","watch-connectivity message schema"],"zh":["Watch 连接性","SwiftUI","HealthKit","iOS 开发","间歇性禁食跟踪","玻璃形设计","WCSession 管理器","AI エージェント"],"ja":["Watch 接続性","SwiftUI","HealthKit","iOS 開発","間歇性禁食トラッカー","ガラスモルフィック デザイン","WCSession マネージャー","AI エージェント"],"ko":["ウォッチ 커넥티ビティ","SwiftUI","HealthKit","iOS 개발","간歇적 금식 트래커","유리 모르픽 디자인","WCSession 관리자","AI 에이전트"],"es":["watch-connectivity","iOS","SwiftUI","HealthKit","diseño glassmorphic","seguimiento de la salud","ayuno intermitente","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","integración de watch-connectivity","errores de conexión"],"fr":["watch-connectivity","iOS","SwiftUI","HealthKit","conception glassmorphic","suivi de la santé","jeûne intermittent","développement d''applications mobiles","intégration de watch-connectivity","erreurs de connexion"],"de":["watch-connectivity","iOS","SwiftUI","HealthKit","glassmorphic-Design","Gesundheitsüberwachung","intermittierendes Fasten","App-Entwicklung","Integration von watch-connectivity","Verbindungsfehler"],"pt":["watch-connectivity","iOS","HealthKit","SwiftUI","glassmorphic design","WCSession","falhas e atrasos","testes de codificação e decodificação"],"ru":["watch-connectivity","iOS","HealthKit","SwiftUI","стекломорфный дизайн","WCSession","ошибки и задержки","тесты кодирования и декодирования","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["الوصول إلى الاتصال الساعي","آي أو إس","HealthKit","SwiftUI","تصميم زجاجي مورفي","جلسة WCSession","أخطاء وتأخيرات","اختبارات الترميز وفك الترميز","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Maduixa","repo":"Glasstic","repoPath":"Maduixa/Glasstic","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.316Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"watch-connectivity","description":"WatchConnectivity patterns + dual-target sync flows; also complications/widgets pointers.","bodyPreview":"Load:\n- @docs/watch/README.md\n- @docs/watch/watchconnectivity.md\n- @docs/watch/background-execution.md\n\nOutput:\n- Message schema (keys, payload types, versioning)\n- iOS WCSession manager + watch WCSession manager skeletons\n- Failure handling strategy (not reachable, delays)\n- Minimal tests for encoding/decoding","body":"Load:\n- @docs/watch/README.md\n- @docs/watch/watchconnectivity.md\n- @docs/watch/background-execution.md\n\nOutput:\n- Message schema (keys, payload types, versioning)\n- iOS WCSession manager + watch WCSession manager skeletons\n- Failure handling strategy (not reachable, delays)\n- Minimal tests for encoding/decoding\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:51.050Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for iOS Development Agents needing seamless HealthKit integration and glassmorphic design for intermittent fasting tracker apps.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝集成HealthKit和玻璃形设计的iOS开发代理，用于间歇性禁食跟踪应用。","ja":"HealthKitのシームレスな統合とガラスモルフィックデザインを必要とするiOS開発エージェントに最適です。間欠性断食トラッカー アプリ向けです。","ko":"HealthKit와 유리형 디자인을无缝하게 통합해야 하는 iOS 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 간헐적 금식 트래커 앱을 위한 것입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de iOS que necesitan una integración sin problemas con HealthKit y un diseño glassmorphic para aplicaciones de seguimiento de ayuno intermitente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement iOS nécessitant une intégration transparente de HealthKit et un design glassmorphic pour les applications de suivi du jeûne intermittent.","de":"Perfekt für iOS-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine nahtlose HealthKit-Integration und ein glassmorphic-Design für intermittierende Fasten-Tracker-Apps benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento iOS que necessitam de integração sem problemas do HealthKit e design glassmórfico para aplicativos de rastreadores de jejum intermitente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки iOS, которым необходима бесперебойная интеграция HealthKit и стеклянный дизайн для приложений отслеживания интервального голодания.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل صحي متكامل مع HealthKit وتصميم زجاجي لمحاكمة تطبيق تتبع الصيام المتقطع للآيفون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to establish reliable WatchConnectivity sessions using WCSession managers, ensuring efficient data exchange and synchronization between iOS devices and Apple Watches, while handling failures and delays through robust error handling strategies.","zh":"赋予代理建立可靠的WatchConnectivity会话的能力，使用WCSession管理器，确保iOS设备和Apple Watch之间的高效数据交换和同步，同时通过强大的错误处理策略处理故障和延迟。","ja":"WCSessionマネージャーを使用して、エージェントが信頼性の高いWatchConnectivityセッションを確立できるようにします。iOSデバイスとApple Watch之间の効率的なデータ交換と同期を保証し、強力なエラーハンドリング戦略を通じて障害と遅延を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 신뢰할 수 있는 WatchConnectivity 세션을 설정할 수 있도록 WCSession 관리자를 사용하여 iOS 기기와 Apple Watch 간의 효율적인 데이터 교환 및 동기화를 보장하고 강력한 오류 처리 전략을 통해 장애와 지연을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a establecer sesiones de WatchConnectivity confiables utilizando administradores de WCSession, lo que garantiza un intercambio y sincronización de datos eficientes entre dispositivos iOS y Apple Watches, mientras se manejan fallos y retrasos a través de estrategias de control de errores sólidas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''établir des sessions WatchConnectivity fiables en utilisant des gestionnaires de WCSession, garantissant un échange et une synchronisation de données efficaces entre les appareils iOS et les Apple Watches, tout en gérant les défaillances et les retards grâce à des stratégies de gestion des erreurs solides.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, zuverlässige WatchConnectivity-Sitzungen mit WCSession-Managern herzustellen, was einen effizienten Daten Austausch und eine Synchronisierung zwischen iOS-Geräten und Apple Uhren gewährleistet, während Fehler und Verzögerungen durch robuste Fehlerbehandlungsstrategien gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes estabeleçam sessões WatchConnectivity confiáveis usando gerentes de WCSession, garantindo troca e sincronização eficientes de dados entre dispositivos iOS e Apple Watches, lidando com falhas e atrasos por meio de estratégias de tratamento de erros robustas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам устанавливать надежные сессии WatchConnectivity с помощью менеджеров WCSession, обеспечивая эффективный обмен и синхронизацию данных между устройствами iOS и Apple Watch, а также обрабатывая сбои и задержки посредством прочных стратегий обработки ошибок.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء إنشاء جلسات WatchConnectivity موثوقة باستخدام مديري WCSession، مما يضمن تبادل البيانات وتزامنها بكفاءة بين أجهزة آيفون وساعات آبل، مع معالجة الفشل والتأخير من خلال استراتيجيات معالجة الأخطاء القوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing HealthKit integration for fitness tracking","Designing glassmorphic interfaces for iOS and watchOS apps","Debugging WatchConnectivity issues with WCSession managers"],"zh":["为健身跟踪实现HealthKit集成","为iOS和watchOS应用设计玻璃形界面","使用WCSession管理器调试WatchConnectivity问题"],"ja":["フィットネストラッキングのためのHealthKit統合の実装","iOSおよびwatchOSアプリのガラスモルフィックインターフェイスの設計","WCSessionマネージャーを使用したWatchConnectivityの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["피트니스 추적을 위한 HealthKit 통합 구현","iOS 및 watchOS 앱을 위한 유리형 인터페이스 설계","WCSession 관리자를 사용한 WatchConnectivity 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Implementar la integración de HealthKit para el seguimiento de la condición física","Diseñar interfaces glassmorphic para aplicaciones iOS y watchOS","Depurar problemas de WatchConnectivity con administradores de WCSession"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre l''intégration de HealthKit pour le suivi de la condition physique","Concevoir des interfaces glassmorphic pour les applications iOS et watchOS","Déboguer les problèmes de WatchConnectivity avec des gestionnaires de WCSession"],"de":["Implementierung der HealthKit-Integration für die Fitness-Verfolgung","Entwerfen von glassmorphic-Oberflächen für iOS- und watchOS-Apps","Fehlerbehebung von WatchConnectivity-Problemen mit WCSession-Managern"],"pt":["Implementar integração do HealthKit para rastreamento de condicionamento físico","Projetar interfaces glassmórficas para aplicativos iOS e watchOS","Depurar problemas de WatchConnectivity com gerentes de WCSession"],"ru":["Реализовать интеграцию HealthKit для отслеживания фитнеса","Разработать стеклянные интерфейсы для приложений iOS и watchOS","Отладить проблемы WatchConnectivity с менеджерами WCSession"],"ar":["تنفيذ تكامل HealthKit لتتبع اللياقة البدنية","تصميم واجهات زجاجية لتطبيقات آيفون وساعات آبل","تصحيح أخطاء WatchConnectivity مع مديري WCSession"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires iOS and watchOS development environment","Limited to HealthKit and WatchConnectivity frameworks","Needs SwiftUI for user interface design"],"zh":["需要iOS和watchOS开发环境","仅限于HealthKit和WatchConnectivity框架","需要SwiftUI进行用户界面设计"],"ja":["iOSおよびwatchOS開発環境が必要","HealthKitおよびWatchConnectivityフレームワークのみに限定される","ユーザーインターフェイスのデザインにはSwiftUIが必要"],"ko":["iOS 및 watchOS 개발 환경이 필요","HealthKit 및 WatchConnectivity 프레임워크로만 제한","사용자 인터페이스 설계를 위해 SwiftUI가 필요"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de desarrollo de iOS y watchOS","Limitado a los marcos de HealthKit y WatchConnectivity","Necesita SwiftUI para el diseño de la interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement iOS et watchOS","Limité aux cadres de HealthKit et WatchConnectivity","Nécessite SwiftUI pour la conception de l''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt eine iOS- und watchOS-Entwicklungsumgebung","Begrenzt auf die Frameworks HealthKit und WatchConnectivity","Benötigt SwiftUI für das Benutzeroberflächendesign"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de desenvolvimento iOS e watchOS","Limitado aos frameworks HealthKit e WatchConnectivity","Necessita SwiftUI para design de interface do usuário"],"ru":["Требуется среда разработки iOS и watchOS","Ограничен фреймворками HealthKit и WatchConnectivity","Требуется SwiftUI для проектирования пользовательского интерфейса"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير آيفون وساعات آبل","محدود بإطارات HealthKit و WatchConnectivity","يحتاج إلى SwiftUI لتصميم واجهة المستخدم"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"cbc5f7814ffa666eb34c159ad31d663b16692afff8a38611368b4331983b90d4","qualityScore":26}');
