ساعتين."},"seo":{"title":{"en":"plan-app: Guided App Planning Setup Guide | AI Agent Skill","zh":"Plan App 设置指南：AI 工具快速构建应用","ja":"Plan App セットアップガイド：AI エージェントによるアプリ構築","ko":"Plan App 설정 가이드: AI 에이전트로 빠른 애플리케이션 구축","es":"Guía de Configuración para plan-app: Creación Rápida de A...","fr":"Guide de Configuration pour plan-app : Création d''Applica...","de":"Konfigurationsleitfaden für plan-app: Schnellstellung von...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Plan App: Crie um Aplicativo Comp...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Руководство по Настройке Plan App для Быстрого...","ar":"دليل إعداد план التطبيق: إنشاء تطبيق كامل في غضون ساعتين"},"description":{"en":"Get started with plan-app and learn how to build a complete app in ~2 hours through guided planning and parallel sub-agent execution. Read the reference file...","zh":"了解 Plan App 技术，快速构建完整应用，实现 2 小时内完成指导规划和并行子代理执行","ja":"Plan App 技術を活用して、2 時間以内にアプリを構築するためのガイド付き計画と並行サブエージェント実行を実現","ko":"Plan App 기술로 2시간 내에 완전한 애플리케이션을 구축하고, 가이드 계획 및 병렬 서브 에이전트 실행을实现","es":"Aprende a configurar plan-app para crear aplicaciones en ~2 horas con nuestro taller de configuración y ejecución paralela de subagentes","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer plan-app pour créer des applications en ~2 heures avec notre atelier de configuration et d''exécution parallèle de sous-agents","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie plan-app konfigurieren, um Anwendungen in ~2 Stunden mit unserem Konfigurations-Workshop und paralleler Sub-Agent-Ausführung zu erstellen","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o Plan App para criar um aplicativo completo em 2 horas com nosso guia passo a passo","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить Plan App для быстрой разработки полноценного приложения за 2 часа","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد.plan التطبيق لإنشاء تطبيق كامل في غضون ساعتين مع دليلنا خطوة بخطوة"},"definition":{"en":"plan-app is a skill that provides a workshop setup bootstrap for Claude Code training, guiding developers through a phased approach to build a complete app.","zh":"Plan App 是一种 AI 工具，用于快速构建应用","ja":"Plan App は、AI エージェントを使用してアプリを構築するための技術","ko":"Plan App는 AI 에이전트를 사용하여 애플리케이션을 빠르게 구축하는 기술","es":"El plan-app es una herramienta de configuración para la creación rápida de aplicaciones con Claude Code","fr":"Le plan-app est un outil de configuration pour la création rapide d''applications avec Claude Code","de":"Der plan-app ist ein Konfigurationstool für die schnelle Erstellung von Anwendungen mit Claude Code","pt":"O Plan App é uma ferramenta de planejamento de aplicativos que ajuda a criar um aplicativo completo em 2 horas","ru":"Plan App - это инструмент планирования приложений, помогающий создать полноценное приложение за 2 часа","ar":"PLAN التطبيق هو أداة تخطيط التطبيقات التي تساعد على إنشاء تطبيق كامل في غضون ساعتين"},"features":{"en":["Executes a phased approach with mandatory flow","Reads reference files in MD format, such as `reference/01-interview.md`","Supports parallel sub-agent execution for efficient app building","Guides developers through an interview phase to understand app concepts","Enables developers to describe the app concept back to users"],"zh":["2小时内完成应用构建","指导规划和并行子代理执行","支持多阶段应用开发","实现快速应用原型设计"],"ja":["2時間以内にアプリを構築","ガイド付き計画と並行サブエージェント実行","多段階アプリ開発に対応","迅速なアプリ原型設計を実現"],"ko":["2시간 내에 애플리케이션 구축","가이드 계획 및 병렬 서브 에이전트 실행","다단계 애플리케이션 개발 지원","빠른 애플리케이션 프로토 타이핑"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones en ~2 horas","Guía de planificación para entender el concepto de la aplicación","Ejecución paralela de subagentes para una creación eficiente","Fase de entrevista para determinar el concepto y los casos de uso de la aplicación","Compatibilidad con Claude Code para una integración sin problemas"],"fr":["Création d''applications en ~2 heures","Guide de planification pour comprendre le concept de l''application","Exécution parallèle de sous-agents pour une création efficace","Phase d''entretien pour déterminer le concept et les cas d''utilisation de l''application","Compatibilité avec Claude Code pour une intégration sans problème"],"de":["Erstellung von Anwendungen in ~2 Stunden","Planungsanleitung zum Verständnis des AnwendungsKonzepts","Parallele Ausführung von Sub-Agenten für eine effiziente Erstellung","Interview-Phase zur Bestimmung des AnwendungsKonzepts und der Anwendungsfälle","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code für eine reibungslose Integration"],"pt":["Criação de um aplicativo completo em 2 horas","Configuração de workshop para treinamento de código Claude","Execução paralela de sub-agentes","Fases de planejamento guiadas"],"ru":["Создание полноценного приложения за 2 часа","Настройка семинара для обучения коду Claude","Параллельное выполнение суб-агентов","Фазы планирования с гидом"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيق كامل في غضون ساعتين","إعداد ورشة عمل لتدريب كلود كود","تنفيذ متوازي للوكلاء الفرعيين","مراحل التخطيط الموجهة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use plan-app","plan-app setup guide","what is plan-app","plan-app alternative","plan-app vs Claude Code","plan-app install","guided app planning","parallel sub-agent execution","Claude Code training"],"zh":["Plan App","AI 工具","快速应用构建","指导规划","并行子代理执行","应用开发","原型设计"],"ja":["Plan App","AI エージェント","迅速なアプリ構築","ガイド付き計画","並行サブエージェント実行","アプリ開発","原型設計"],"ko":["Plan App","AI 에이전트","빠른 애플리케이션 구축","가이드 계획","병렬 서브 에이전트 실행","애플리케이션 개발","프로토 타이핑"],"es":["plan-app","Claude Code","creación de aplicaciones","configuración de aplicaciones","herramientas de desarrollo","desarrollo de aplicaciones rápidas","entrevista de planificación","ejecución paralela de subagentes","Agentes de IA para desarrollo"],"fr":["plan-app","Claude Code","création d''applications","configuration d''applications","outils de développement","développement d''applications rapides","entretien de planification","exécution parallèle de sous-agents","Agents d''IA pour le développement"],"de":["plan-app","Claude Code","Erstellung von Anwendungen","Konfiguration von Anwendungen","Entwicklungstools","schnelle AnwendungsErstellung","PlanungsInterview","parallele Sub-Agent-Ausführung","KI-Agents für die Entwicklung"],"pt":["plan app","criação de aplicativos","configuração de workshop","treinamento de código claude","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","ferramentas de planejamento"],"ru":["plan app","создание приложений","настройка семинара","обучение коду claude","разработка приложений","инструменты планирования"],"ar":["plan التطبيق","إنشاء التطبيقات","إعداد ورشة العمل","تدريب كلود كود","تطوير التطبيقات","أدوات التخطيط"]}},"owner":"teren-papercutlabs","repo":"pcl-workshop-setup","repoPath":"teren-papercutlabs/pcl-workshop-setup","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.360Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan-app","description":"MANDATORY INVOCATION: This skill MUST be invoked for building workshop apps. Guides the full flow from idea to deployed app: interview, screen flows, decomposition into sub-agents, parallel build, and merge. Trigger for: :plan-app macro, building an app, app planning, workshop app build.","bodyPreview":"# Plan App\n\nBuild a complete app in ~2 hours through guided planning and parallel sub-agent execution.\n\n## Flow (MANDATORY - IN ORDER)\n\nComplete each phase before moving to the next. Read the reference file at the START of each phase.\n\n### Phase 1: INTERVIEW\n**Read:** `reference/01-interview.md`\n**When:** Immediately after skill invoked\n**Goal:** Understand what they want to build, who uses it, core use cases\n**Done when:** You have clear app concept and can describe it back to them\n\n### Phase 2","body":"# Plan App\n\nBuild a complete app in ~2 hours through guided planning and parallel sub-agent execution.\n\n## Flow (MANDATORY - IN ORDER)\n\nComplete each phase before moving to the next. Read the reference file at the START of each phase.\n\n### Phase 1: INTERVIEW\n**Read:** `reference/01-interview.md`\n**When:** Immediately after skill invoked\n**Goal:** Understand what they want to build, who uses it, core use cases\n**Done when:** You have clear app concept and can describe it back to them\n\n### Phase 2: SCREEN FLOWS\n**Read:** `reference/02-screen-flows.md`\n**When:** Interview complete\n**Goal:** Create wireframes + user journeys (combined, not separate)\n**Done when:** Participant approves the screen flows\n\n### Phase 3: DECOMPOSITION\n**Read:** `reference/03-decomposition.md`\n**When:** Screen flows approved\n**Goal:** Split work into Foundation + Feature agents\n**Done when:** Sub-agent MD files written to `/docs/agents/`\n\n### Phase 4: DISPATCH\n**Read:** `reference/04-dispatch.md`\n**When:** MD files ready\n**Goal:** Run Foundation agent, then feature agents in parallel (same repo, file ownership prevents conflicts)\n**Done when:** All sub-agents have returned\n\n### Phase 5: TESTING\n**Read:** `reference/05-testing.md`\n**When:** All sub-agents complete\n**Goal:** Automated verification + user testing\n**Done when:** All checks pass, user confirms it works\n\n### Phase 6: DEPLOY\n**Read:** `reference/06-deploy.md`\n**When:** Testing complete\n**Goal:** Deploy to Vercel\n**Done when:** App running on Vercel with live URL\n\n## Project Location\n\nCreate the project folder in the current working directory. Use a slugified version of the app name:\n- \"Campaign Archive\" → `./campaign-archive/`\n- \"Team Wiki\" → `./team-wiki/`\n\nDo not ask the user where to put it. Just create it in the current directory.\n\n## Hard Limits\n\nEnforce these during interview. If app exceeds limits, help them cut scope.\n\n- **Max 4 screens**\n- **Max 2 tables**\n- **Max 2 external APIs**\n\n## Tech Stack (Non-negotiable)\n\nDo not offer choices. These are prescribed:\n\n- **Framework:** Next.js (App Router)\n- **Database:** Supabase (via Vercel integration)\n- **UI:** ShadCN\n- **Auth:** Supabase Auth with email/password (if needed)\n- **Hosting:** Vercel\n\n## Planning Outputs\n\nAll written to `/docs/` in the project:\n\n| File | Contents |\n|------|----------|\n| `/docs/screen-flows.md` | Wireframes + user journeys (approved by participant) |\n| `/docs/agents/foundation.md` | Foundation agent brief |\n| `/docs/agents/feature-*.md` | Feature agent briefs (one per feature) |"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:13.230Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing rapid app prototyping and guided planning capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要快速应用原型开发和指导规划能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが迅速なアプリのプロトタイプ作成とガイド付きの計画機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"빨리 애플리케이션 프로토 타입 개발 및 가이드 계획 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan prototipado de aplicaciones rápidas y capacidades de planificación guiada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''un prototypage d''applications rapide et de capacités de planification guidée.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die ein schnelles App-Prototyping und Leitfaden-Planungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento que necessitam de prototipagem rápida de aplicativos e capacidades de planejamento guiado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима быстрая прототипизация приложений и возможности планирования под руководством.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطويين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات بروتوكول وتخطيط توجيه سريع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build complete apps in ~2 hours through guided planning and parallel sub-agent execution, utilizing reference files and phased development, including interview, analysis, and execution phases.","zh":"通过指导规划和并行子代理执行，利用参考文件和分阶段开发，包括面试、分析和执行阶段，能够在约2小时内使代理构建完整的应用程序。","ja":"ガイド付きの計画と並行したサブエージェントの実行を利用し、リファレンスファイルと段階的な開発を使用し、面接、分析、実行の各段階を含めて、エージェントが約2時間で完全なアプリを構築できるようにします。","ko":"가이드 계획 및 병렬 서브 에이전트 실행을 통해 참고 파일 및 단계별 개발을 사용하여 인터뷰, 분석 및 실행 단계를 포함하여 에이전트가 약 2시간 내에 완전한 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones completas en ~2 horas a través de la planificación guiada y la ejecución paralela de subagentes, utilizando archivos de referencia y desarrollo por fases, incluyendo las fases de entrevista, análisis y ejecución.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications complètes en ~2 heures grâce à la planification guidée et à l''exécution parallèle de sous-agents, en utilisant des fichiers de référence et un développement par phases, y compris les phases d''entretien, d''analyse et d''exécution.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, in ~2 Stunden komplette Apps durch Guided Planning und parallele Sub-Agenten-Ausführung zu erstellen, unter Verwendung von Referenzdateien und phasenweisem Entwicklungsprozess, einschließlich Interview-, Analyse- und Ausführungsphasen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos completos em ~2 horas por meio de planejamento guiado e execução paralela de sub-agentes, utilizando arquivos de referência e desenvolvimento faseado, incluindo fases de entrevista, análise e execução.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать полноценные приложения за ~2 часа через руководство по планированию и параллельную работу подчиненных агентов, используя справочные файлы и фазовую разработку, включая этапы интервью, анализа и выполнения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات كاملة في ~2 ساعة من خلال تخطيط توجيهي وتنفيذ متوازي للوكلاء الفرعيين، باستخدام ملفات مرجعية وتنمية متدرجة، بما في ذلك مراحل المقابلة والتحليل والتنفيذ"},"useCases":{"en":["Rapidly prototyping mobile apps","Guiding developers through app planning","Executing parallel sub-agent tasks for efficient development"],"zh":["快速原型开发移动应用","指导开发者完成应用规划","执行并行子代理任务以实现高效开发"],"ja":["モバイルアプリの迅速なプロトタイプ開発","開発者向けのアプリ計画のガイド","並行したサブエージェントタスクの実行による効率的な開発"],"ko":["모바일 애플리케이션 빠른 프로토 타입 개발","개발자에게 애플리케이션 계획 가이드","병렬 서브 에이전트 작업 실행을 통한 효율적인 개발"],"es":["Prototipado rápido de aplicaciones móviles","Guía a los desarrolladores a través de la planificación de aplicaciones","Ejecución de tareas de subagentes paralelos para un desarrollo eficiente"],"fr":["Prototypage rapide d''applications mobiles","Guidage des développeurs à travers la planification d''applications","Exécution de tâches de sous-agents parallèles pour un développement efficace"],"de":["Schnelles Prototyping von Mobile Apps","Anleitung für Entwickler bei der App-Planung","Ausführung von parallelen Sub-Agenten-Aufgaben für effizientes Entwickeln"],"pt":["Prototipagem rápida de aplicativos móveis","Orientação de desenvolvedores durante o planejamento de aplicativos","Execução de tarefas de sub-agente paralelo para desenvolvimento eficiente"],"ru":["Быстрая прототипизация мобильных приложений","Руководство разработчиками при планировании приложений","Выполнение параллельных задач подчиненных агентов для эффективной разработки"],"ar":["بروتوكول سريع لتطبيقات الهاتف المحمول","توجيه المطورين خلال تخطيط التطبيقات","تنفيذ مهام متوازية للوكلاء الفرعيين من أجل التطوير الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ~2 hours of development time","Guided planning and parallel execution must be followed in order"],"zh":["需要约2小时的开发时间","指导规划和并行执行必须按顺序进行"],"ja":["約2時間の開発時間が必要","ガイド付きの計画と並行実行は順序通りに実行する必要がある"],"ko":["약 2시간의 개발 시간이 필요","가이드 계획 및 병렬 실행은 순서대로 진행되어야 함"],"es":["Requiere ~2 horas de tiempo de desarrollo","La planificación guiada y la ejecución paralela deben seguirse en orden"],"fr":["Nécessite ~2 heures de temps de développement","La planification guidée et l''exécution parallèle doivent être suivies dans l''ordre"],"de":["Benötigt ~2 Stunden Entwicklungszeit","Guided Planning und parallele Ausführung müssen in der richtigen Reihenfolge durchgeführt werden"],"pt":["Requer ~2 horas de tempo de desenvolvimento","O planejamento guiado e a execução paralela devem ser seguidos por ordem"],"ru":["Требуется ~2 часа времени разработки","Руководство по планированию и параллельная работа должны выполняться в порядке"],"ar":["يتطلب ~2 ساعة من وقت التطوير","يجب اتباع التخطيط التوجيهي والتنفيذ المتوازي بالترتيب"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1c32e69e715a2c9c4a55519b2ad122d5669ccfe3db1c29d7f1eaf55565557362","qualityScore":26}');
