chnis standardmäßig"],"pt":["Utiliza scripts em bash para automação de fluxo de trabalho","Gerenciamento de dependências com script de verificação","Configuração de diretório de estado personalizado","Suporte a nomes curtos para comandos"],"ru":["Использует скрипты bash для автоматизации рабочих процессов","Управление зависимостями с помощью скрипта проверки","Настройка пользовательского каталога состояния","Поддержка коротких имен для команд"],"ar":["يستخدم سكريبتات bash لتحسين مسارات العمل","إدارة الإعتماديات مع سكريبت فحص","ضبط دليل الحالة المخصص","دعم أسماء قصيرة للأوامر"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use tmux-workflow","tmux-workflow setup guide","tmux-workflow alternative","what is tmux-workflow","tmux-workflow install","tmux-workflow vs other workflow tools","configuring tmux-workflow state directory","tmux-workflow worker management","tmux-workflow bash scripts"],"zh":["tmux-workflow","开发工作流","优化生产力","工具包","快速启动","状态目录配置","AI工具","AIエージェント"],"ja":["tmux-workflow","開発ワークフロー","生産性の向上","ツールキット","クイックスタート","ステートディレクトリの設定","AIエージェント","開発ツール"],"ko":["tmux-workflow","개발 워크플로우","생산성 향상","툴킷","빠른 시작","상태 디렉토리 구성","AI 툴","개발 도구"],"es":["tmux-workflow","herramientas de desarrollo","productividad para desarrolladores","scripts de bash","automatización de tareas","configuración de estado","verificación de dependencias","ejecución de comandos","herramientas de flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["tmux-workflow","outils de développement","productivité pour les développeurs","scripts bash","automatisation des tâches","configuration d''état","vérification des dépendances","exécution de commandes","outils de flux de travail"],"de":["tmux-workflow","Entwicklungstools","Produktivität für Entwickler","Bash-Skripte","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Konfiguration des Status","Überprüfung von Abhängigkeiten","Ausführung von Befehlen","Werkzeuge für den Arbeitsfluss"],"pt":["tmux-workflow","automação de fluxo de trabalho","scripts em bash","gerenciamento de dependências","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","automatização de processos"],"ru":["tmux-workflow","автоматизация рабочих процессов","скрипты bash","управление зависимостями","инструменты разработки","автоматизация процессов"],"ar":["tmux-workflow","تحسين مسارات العمل","سكريبتات bash","إدارة الإعتماديات","أدوات التطوير","ت 자동ية العمليات"]}},"owner":"kunhuang12345","repo":"team-skill","repoPath":"kunhuang12345/team-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.380Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tmux-workflow","description":"Portable tmux-based workflow to drive one or multiple long-running Codex CLI “workers” from another process (e.g. Claude CLI) by (1) starting/reusing a tmux session running `codex`, (2) injecting prompts into the Codex pane via `tmux send-keys`/buffer paste, and (3) polling the worker’s Codex JSONL session logs to extract the next assistant reply. Each worker runs with an isolated `CODEX_HOME` (default `~/.codex-workers/<worker_id>`) to prevent log cross-talk when multiple Codex workers run concurrently. Use when you need to submit/wait/read Codex replies in tmux, manage multiple Codex workers, or troubleshoot the tmux worker and log binding.","bodyPreview":"# tmux-workflow\n\nThis skill is a self-contained toolkit under `scripts/` (copy this whole folder to any repo’s `.codex/skills/` or to `~/.codex/skills/`).\n\n## Quick start (Claude → Codex)\n\n1. (Optional) Check deps:\n   - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/check_deps.sh`\n2. Start a worker and ask with short names (state directory is configurable; default is `<skill_root>/.twf/`):\n   - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/twf codex-a`\n   - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/twf c","body":"# tmux-workflow\n\nThis skill is a self-contained toolkit under `scripts/` (copy this whole folder to any repo’s `.codex/skills/` or to `~/.codex/skills/`).\n\n## Quick start (Claude → Codex)\n\n1. (Optional) Check deps:\n   - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/check_deps.sh`\n2. Start a worker and ask with short names (state directory is configurable; default is `<skill_root>/.twf/`):\n   - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/twf codex-a`\n   - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/twf codex-a \"你好\"`\n\n## Scripts\n\n- `scripts/codex_up_tmux.sh`: start/reuse the worker and write `./.codex-tmux-session.json` (JSON) in the current directory; sync `~/.codex` into per-worker `CODEX_HOME`.\n- `scripts/codex_ask.py`: inject text into the tmux pane and poll Codex `sessions/*.jsonl` until the next assistant reply appears.\n- `scripts/codex_pend.py`: print the latest reply (or last N Q/A pairs) from the bound or auto-detected Codex log.\n- `scripts/codex_ping.py`: health check for tmux worker and log binding.\n- `scripts/sync_codex_home.py`: sync `~/.codex` into a per-worker `CODEX_HOME` (excludes `sessions/`, `log/`, `history.jsonl`).\n- `scripts/twf`: recommended wrapper for managing many workers: `up/ask/pend/ping/stop/resume/spawn/tree/list/remove` with automatic naming and “pick latest” behavior.\n- `scripts/install_claude_cmds.sh` (optional): install Claude custom commands (`/cask`, `/cpend`, `/cping`) that call this skill’s scripts.\n\n## Recommended usage (`twf`)\n\n### Naming rules (base vs full name)\n\n- **Base name**: short label like `codex-a`.\n- **Full name**: auto-generated unique worker id: `<base>-YYYYmmdd-HHMMSS-<pid>` (also used as tmux session name).\n- `twf <base>` creates a new full-name worker and writes state to `<state_dir>/<full>.json`.\n- `twf <base> \"msg\"` will use the **latest** full-name worker for that base (by state-file mtime). If none exists, it auto-creates one.\n- `remove` always requires **full name** to avoid deleting the wrong worker.\n\nState directory:\n- default: configured via `scripts/twf_config.yaml` (`twf.state_dir.mode`, default `auto`; legacy: `twf_state_dir_mode`)\n  - `auto`: `<skill_root>/.twf/` (project install default: `./.codex/skills/tmux-workflow/.twf/`)\n  - `global`: `~/.twf/`\n  - `manual`: `twf.state_dir.dir` (must be set in config; relative paths resolve from current directory; legacy: `twf_state_dir`)\n- override: `TWF_STATE_DIR=/some/path` (highest priority; ignores `twf.state_dir.mode` / `twf_state_dir_mode`)\n\n### Core commands\n\n- Start a worker (returns the state json path on stdout):\n  - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/twf codex-a`\n  - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/twf up codex-a`\n  - with profile: `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/twf up codex-a -p aihuohua`\n- Ask a worker and print Codex reply to stdout:\n  - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/twf codex-a \"your prompt\"`\n  - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/twf ask codex-a \"your prompt\"`\n- Inspect:\n  - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/twf pend codex-a [N]`\n  - `bash .codex/skills/tmux-workflow/scripts/twf ping codex-a`\n\n### Stop / Resume (resume keeps logs)\n\n- `twf stop <name|full-name>`: stop tmux session, keep state + `CODEX_HOME` (so it can be resumed later).\n- `twf resume <name|full-name>`: resume a stopped worker.\n  - default: resume the worker **and its subtree** (children).\n  - `--no-tree`: resume only this node.\n\nResume source id:\n- `twf stop` stores `codex_resume_from_id` by reading the latest `session_meta.payload.id` from that worker’s newest `*.jsonl` log.\n- `twf resume` uses `codex resume <id>` when `codex_resume_from_id` exists; otherwise falls back to a fresh `codex` session.\n\n### Parent/Child workers (“sub-codex”)\n\nCreate a child worker and link it to a parent:\n- `twf spawn <parent-full> <child-base> [up-args...]`\n\nNotes:\n- parent must be **full name** (unique).\n- child is created as a new full-name worker and recorded into:\n  - child: `parent=<parent-full>`\n  - parent: `children[] += <child-full>`\n\nShow structure:\n- `twf tree [root-full]`\n- `twf list [--running|--stopped|--orphans]`\n\n### Remove (destructive)\n\n- `twf remove <full-name>`: **default recursive** delete of the node + its subtree:\n  - kills tmux sessions\n  - deletes worker `CODEX_HOME`\n  - deletes state json files\n- `twf remove <full-name> --no-recursive`: delete only the single node\n\nSafety:\n- `remove` only deletes `codex_home` if it is under `TWF_WORKERS_DIR` (or default `~/.codex-workers`); otherwise it refuses and asks you to delete manually.\n\n## Environment knobs\n\n### Low-level (`codex_up_tmux.sh` and friends)\n\n- `TWF_SESSION_FILE`: session file path (default: `./.codex-tmux-session.json`).\n- `TWF_TMUX_SESSION`: override tmux session name (default: `codex-<hash(cwd)>`).\n- `TWF_CODEX_CMD_CONFIG`: YAML/JSON config path (default: `scripts/twf_config.yaml`). Nested keys (legacy flat keys also supported):\n  - `codex.model`, `codex.model_reasoning_effort`, `codex.profile`\n  - `twf.state_dir.mode`, `twf.state_dir.dir`\n  - `twf.account_pool.enabled`, `twf.account_pool.cmd`, `twf.account_pool.auth_team.dir`, `twf.account_pool.auth_team.glob`, `twf.account_pool.auth_team.strategy`\n  - `twf.auth.src`, `twf.env.allow_overrides`\n- `TWF_CODEX_CMD`: override the full command used inside tmux (if unset, it is built from `TWF_CODEX_CMD_CONFIG`).\n- `TWF_WORKERS_DIR`: per-worker `CODEX_HOME` base dir (default: `~/.codex-workers`).\n- `TWF_CODEX_HOME_SRC`: source `CODEX_HOME` to copy from (default: `~/.codex`).\n- `TWF_AUTH_SRC`: optional auth file to copy into worker as `auth.json` (overrides synced `auth.json`).\n- `TWF_ACCOUNT_POOL_CMD`: optional path to `codex-account-pool/scripts/cap` (takes precedence over `twf_account_pool_cmd`).\n- `TWF_CODEX_SESSION_ROOT` / `CODEX_SESSION_ROOT` / `CODEX_HOME`: where to scan logs (default: `~/.codex/sessions`).\n- `TWF_WATCH_MODE` (default `auto`):\n  - `auto`: on Linux/WSL use `inotify` to block until the log file changes; otherwise fall back to polling.\n  - `poll`: always polling with `TWF_POLL_INTERVAL`.\n  - `inotify`: force `inotify` (falls back to polling if unavailable).\n- `TWF_POLL_INTERVAL` (seconds, default `0.05`), `TWF_TIMEOUT` (seconds, default `3600`).\n- `TWF_STATE_DIR`: override twf wrapper state dir (highest priority).\n- `TWF_SUBMIT_DELAY` (seconds, default `0.5`): delay between injecting text and pressing Enter in tmux (workaround for Codex TUI paste-burst behavior).\n- `TWF_SUBMIT_NUDGE_AFTER` (seconds, default `0.7`) and `TWF_SUBMIT_NUDGE_MAX` (default `2`): if the prompt appears to be typed but not submitted, send extra Enter keypresses while waiting for logs to acknowledge the user message.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:05:37.885Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing advanced workflow management and configurable state directories.","zh":"适合需要高级工作流管理和可配置状态目录的开发者代理。","ja":"高度なワークフロ管理と設定可能な状態ディレクトリを必要とするデベロッパーエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 워크플ロー 관리 및 구성 가능한 상태 디렉토리가 필요한 개발자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo avanzada y directorios de estado configurables.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion de workflow avancée et des répertoires d''état configurables.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickler-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Workflow-Verwaltung und konfigurierbare Statusverzeichnisse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho avançado e diretórios de estado configuráveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков, которым требуется продвинутый менеджмент рабочих процессов и настраиваемые директории состояния.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة سير عمل متقدمة ومديرات حالة قابلة للتكوين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage workflows with a self-contained toolkit, supporting worker management and configurable state directories using bash scripts and a default state directory at `<skill_root>/.twf/`.","zh":"赋予代理管理工作流的能力，具有自包含的工具包，支持工作管理和使用bash脚本以及默认状态目录在`<skill_root>/.twf/`的可配置状态目录。","ja":"エージェントがbashスクリプトとデフォルトの状態ディレクトリ`<skill_root>/.twf/`を使用してワークフローを管理できる、セルフコンテインドのツールキットを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 워크플ロー 관리를 수행할 수 있도록 bash 스크립트와 기본 상태 디렉토리 `<skill_root>/.twf/`를 사용하여 구성 가능한 상태 디렉토리를 지원하는 자체 포함 도구 키트를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar flujos de trabajo con una herramienta de kit autocontenida, que admite la gestión de trabajadores y directorios de estado configurables mediante scripts de bash y un directorio de estado predeterminado en `<skill_root>/.twf/`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les flux de travail avec un kit d''outils autocontenu, prenant en charge la gestion des travailleurs et des répertoires d''état configurables à l''aide de scripts bash et d''un répertoire d''état par défaut à `<skill_root>/.twf/`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Workflows mit einem selbst enthaltenen Toolkit zu verwalten, das die Verwaltung von Arbeitsprozessen und konfigurierbare Statusverzeichnisse mithilfe von Bash-Skripten und einem Standardstatusverzeichnis unter `<skill_root>/.twf/` unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar fluxos de trabalho com um kit de ferramentas autocontido, que suporta gerenciamento de trabalhadores e diretórios de estado configuráveis usando scripts bash e um diretório de estado padrão em `<skill_root>/.twf/`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять рабочими процессами с помощью самодостаточного инструмента, поддерживающего управление рабочими процессами и настраиваемые директории состояния с помощью скриптов bash и директории состояния по умолчанию в `<skill_root>/.twf/`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة سير العمل باستخدام حزمة أدوات مدمجة تدعم إدارة عمال المعالجة ومديرات حالة قابلة للتكوين باستخدام سكربتات bash ومدير حالة افتراضي في `<skill_root>/.twf/`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating workflow setups with configurable state directories","Managing worker processes using bash scripts","Streamlining development workflows with a self-contained toolkit"],"zh":["使用可配置状态目录自动化工作流设置","使用bash脚本管理工作进程","使用自包含工具包简化开发工作流"],"ja":["設定可能な状態ディレクトリを使用してワークフローの設定を自動化する","bashスクリプトを使用してワーカープロセスを管理する","セルフコンテインドのツールキットを使用して開発ワークフローを効率化する"],"ko":["구성 가능한 상태 디렉토리를 사용하여 워크플ロー 설정 자동화","bash 스크립트를 사용하여 작업 프로세스 관리","자체 포함 도구 키트를 사용하여 개발 워크플ロー 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de configuraciones de flujo de trabajo con directorios de estado configurables","Gestión de procesos de trabajo mediante scripts de bash","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con una herramienta de kit autocontenida"],"fr":["Automatisation des configurations de flux de travail avec des répertoires d''état configurables","Gestion des processus de travail à l''aide de scripts bash","Optimisation des flux de travail de développement avec un kit d''outils autocontenu"],"de":["Automatisierung von Workflow-Einrichtungen mit konfigurierbaren Statusverzeichnissen","Verwaltung von Arbeitsprozessen mithilfe von Bash-Skripten","Optimierung von Entwicklungsworkflows mit einem selbst enthaltenen Toolkit"],"pt":["Automatizar configurações de fluxo de trabalho com diretórios de estado configuráveis","Gerenciar processos de trabalhador usando scripts bash","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com um kit de ferramentas autocontido"],"ru":["Автоматизация настройки рабочих процессов с настраиваемыми директориями состояния","Управление рабочими процессами с помощью скриптов bash","Оптимизация рабочих процессов разработки с помощью самодостаточного инструмента"],"ar":["توفير إعدادات سير العمل مع مديرات حالة قابلة للتكوين","إدارة عمال المعالجة باستخدام سكربتات bash","تحسين سير العمل للتطوير باستخدام حزمة أدوات مدمجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires bash scripting support","Dependent on specific directory structure at `.codex/skills/` or `~/.codex/skills/`"],"zh":["需要bash脚本支持","依赖于特定的目录结构在`.codex/skills/`或`~/.codex/skills/`"],"ja":["bashスクリプトのサポートが必要","`.codex/skills/`または`~/.codex/skills/`の特定のディレクトリ構造に依存"],"ko":["bash 스크립트 지원 필요","`.codex/skills/` 또는 `~/.codex/skills/`의 특정 디렉토리 구조에 의존"],"es":["Requiere soporte de secuencias de comandos de bash","Dependiente de una estructura de directorio específica en `.codex/skills/` o `~/.codex/skills/`"],"fr":["Nécessite un support de scripts bash","Dépend d''une structure de répertoire spécifique à `.codex/skills/` ou `~/.codex/skills/`"],"de":["Benötigt Bash-Skript-Unterstützung","Abhängig von einer bestimmten Verzeichnisstruktur unter `.codex/skills/` oder `~/.codex/skills/`"],"pt":["Requer suporte a scripts bash","Dependente de estrutura de diretório específica em `.codex/skills/` ou `~/.codex/skills/`"],"ru":["Требует поддержки скриптов bash","Зависит от конкретной структуры директории в `.codex/skills/` или `~/.codex/skills/`"],"ar":["يتطلب دعمًا لسكربتات bash","يعتمد على هيكل دليل معين في `.codex/skills/` أو `~/.codex/skills/`"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"845f3a0f328e43c253732171d2802540289425d1d891caf18888750aebf119b3","qualityScore":26}');
