Puppeteer を使用","ko":"Node LLM Web Automation 설정 가이드 - Electron UI와 Puppeteer 사용","es":"Guía de configuración de node-llm-web-automation para aut...","fr":"Guide de mise en place de node-llm-web-automation pour l''...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für node-llm-web-automation zur Web...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do node-llm-web-automation para Auto...","ru":"Настройка node-llm-web-automation для Автоматизации Веб-п...","ar":"دليل إعداد node-llm-web-automation للتحكم الآلي في الويب"},"description":{"en":"Automate Codex-driven page exploration with node-llm-web-automation. Learn how to set up deterministic UI flows with Puppeteer and Electron","zh":"使用 Node LLM Web Automation 实现智能教育自动化，Electron UI 和 Puppeteer_runner","ja":"Node LLM Web Automation を使用してスマート教育の自動化を実現する - Electron UI と Puppeteer_runner","ko":"Node LLM Web Automation을 사용하여 스마트 교육 자동화를 구현합니다 - Electron UI와 Puppeteer_runner","es":"Automatice tareas web con node-llm-web-automation, utilizando Electron UI y Puppeteer para flujos de trabajo deterministas","fr":"Automatisez les tâches web avec node-llm-web-automation, en utilisant Electron UI et Puppeteer pour des flux de travail déterministes","de":"Automatisieren Sie Web-Aufgaben mit node-llm-web-automation, das Electron UI und Puppeteer für deterministische Arbeitsflüsse verwendet","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o node-llm-web-automation para automatizar tarefas web com Electron UI e Puppeteer","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить node-llm-web-automation для автоматизации веб-приложений с помощью Electron UI и Puppeteer и ИИ Агентов","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد node-llm-web-automation للتحكم الآلي في التطبيقات الويب مع Electron UI و Puppeteer"},"definition":{"en":"node-llm-web-automation is a Node.js automation tool that uses Electron UI and Puppeteer to drive UI deterministically","zh":"Node LLM Web Automation 是一个使用 Electron UI 和 Puppeteer_runner 实现自动化的 AI工具","ja":"Node LLM Web Automation は Electron UI と Puppeteer_runner を使用して自動化する AIエージェントです","ko":"Node LLM Web Automation은 Electron UI와 Puppeteer_runner를 사용하여 자동화를 구현하는 AI 도구입니다","es":"node-llm-web-automation es una herramienta de automatización web que utiliza Node.js y LLM para automatizar tareas web","fr":"node-llm-web-automation est un outil d''automatisation web qui utilise Node.js et LLM pour automatiser les tâches web","de":"node-llm-web-automation ist ein Tool für die Webautomatisierung, das Node.js und LLM verwendet, um Web-Aufgaben zu automatisieren","pt":"O node-llm-web-automation é uma ferramenta de automação web que converte exploração de páginas manual em um fluxo de automação de baixo custo","ru":"Node-llm-web-automation - это инструмент, преобразующий ручное исследование страниц в автоматизированный поток с низкими затратами","ar":"node-llm-web-automation هو أداة للتحويل من استكشاف الصفحات اليدوي إلى تدفق آلي منخفض التكلفة"},"features":{"en":["Defines automation scope with entry URLs and manual step marking","Implements deterministic UI flows using Puppeteer","Supports pause and resume checkpoints for manual steps like captcha and 2FA","Decides end conditions based on completion badges, video end, or DOM state changes","Uses a single LLM call to pick DOM candidates","Drives UI deterministically for low-cost automation"],"zh":["使用 Electron UI 实现自动化","集成 Puppeteer_runner 驱动 UI","支持定义自动化范围","支持标记手动步骤和提供暂停和恢复检查点","支持决定结束条件"],"ja":["Electron UI を使用して自動化を実現","Puppeteer_runner を使用して UI を駆動","自動化の範囲を定義することができる","手動ステップをマークし、暂停と再開のチェックポイントを提供する","終了条件を決定することができる"],"ko":["Electron UI를 사용하여 자동화를 구현","Puppeteer_runner를 사용하여 UI를 구동","자동화 범위를 정의할 수 있습니다","수동 단계를 표시하고暂停과 재개 확인점을 제공","종료 조건을 결정할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Utiliza Electron UI para la interfaz de usuario","Integra Puppeteer para la automatización de tareas web","Permite la definición del alcance de la automatización","Soporta la implementación de flujos de trabajo deterministas","Utiliza LLM para seleccionar candidatos de DOM","Permite la pausa y reanudación de los flujos de trabajo"],"fr":["Utilise Electron UI pour l''interface utilisateur","Intègre Puppeteer pour l''automatisation des tâches web","Permet de définir l''étendue de l''automatisation","Supporte la mise en œuvre de flux de travail déterministes","Utilise LLM pour sélectionner des candidats de DOM","Permet la pause et la reprise des flux de travail"],"de":["Verwendet Electron UI für die Benutzeroberfläche","Integriert Puppeteer für die Automatisierung von Web-Aufgaben","Ermöglicht die Definition des Automatisierungsumfangs","Unterstützt die Implementierung deterministischer Arbeitsflüsse","Verwendet LLM zur Auswahl von DOM-Kandidaten","Ermöglicht die Pause und Wiederaufnahme von Arbeitsflüssen"],"pt":["Utiliza Electron UI para interface de usuário","Emprega Puppeteer para automação de navegador","Permite definição de escopo de automação","Suporta marcação de etapas manuais e checkpoints","Oferece condição de término personalizável"],"ru":["Использует Electron UI для интерфейса пользователя","Применяет Puppeteer для автоматизации браузера","Позволяет определять область автоматизации","Поддерживает маркировку ручных шагов и контрольных точек","Предоставляет настраиваемое условие завершения"],"ar":["يستخدم Electron UI لواجهة المستخدم","يستخدم Puppeteer للتحكم الآلي في المتصفح","يسمح بتحديد نطاق التحكم الآلي","يدعم علامات الخطوات اليدوية والنقاط التحكمية","يقدم شرط إنهاء قابل للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"en":["node-llm-web-automation setup guide","how to use node-llm-web-automation","what is node-llm-web-automation","node-llm-web-automation alternative","node-llm-web-automation vs puppeteer","node-llm-web-automation install","electron ui automation","puppeteer automation flow","node.js automation tools"],"zh":["Node LLM Web Automation","AI工具","Electron UI","Puppeteer_runner","自动化","智能教育","自动化范围","手动步骤","结束条件"],"ja":["Node LLM Web Automation","AIエージェント","Electron UI","Puppeteer_runner","自動化","スマート教育","自動化の範囲","手動ステップ","終了条件"],"ko":["Node LLM Web Automation","AI 도구","Electron UI","Puppeteer_runner","自动화","스마트 교육","自動화 범위","수동 단계","종료 조건"],"es":["automatización web","node-llm-web-automation","Electron UI","Puppeteer","LLM","automatización de tareas web","flujos de trabajo deterministas","desarrollo web","herramientas de automatización"],"fr":["automatisation web","node-llm-web-automation","Electron UI","Puppeteer","LLM","automatisation de tâches web","flux de travail déterministes","développement web","outils d''automatisation"],"de":["Webautomatisierung","node-llm-web-automation","Electron UI","Puppeteer","LLM","Automatisierung von Web-Aufgaben","deterministische Arbeitsflüsse","Webentwicklung","Automatisierungstools"],"pt":["automação web","node-llm-web-automation","Electron UI","Puppeteer","automatizar tarefas web","ferramenta de automação web","desenvolvimento web","tecnologias web"],"ru":["автоматизация веб-приложений","node-llm-web-automation","Electron UI","Puppeteer","автоматизировать задачи веб","инструмент для автоматизации веб-приложений","разработка веб-приложений","веб-технологии","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في الويب","node-llm-web-automation","Electron UI","Puppeteer","التحكم الآلي في المهام الويب","أداة للتحكم الآلي في التطبيقات الويب","تطوير التطبيقات الويب","تكنولوجيا الويب","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"FrontMage","repo":"codex_helper","repoPath":"FrontMage/codex_helper","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.396Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"node-llm-web-automation","description":"Build or update Node.js + LLM API workflows that replace Codex/MCP UI exploration for web automation at lower cost. Use when a user asks to productize page-structure discovery into a Node runner (Puppeteer/Playwright) with LLM-based element selection, deterministic playback control, cost controls, logging, and fallback paths.","bodyPreview":"# Node LLM Web Automation\n\n## Overview\n\nTurn manual Codex-driven page exploration into a low-cost Node.js automation flow that uses a single LLM call to pick DOM candidates, then drives the UI deterministically.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Define the automation scope\n\n- List entry URLs (login, course detail, list page).\n- Mark manual steps (captcha, 2FA) and provide a pause + resume checkpoint.\n- Decide the end condition (completion badge, video end, DOM state change).\n\n### 2) Implement deterministic c","body":"# Node LLM Web Automation\n\n## Overview\n\nTurn manual Codex-driven page exploration into a low-cost Node.js automation flow that uses a single LLM call to pick DOM candidates, then drives the UI deterministically.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Define the automation scope\n\n- List entry URLs (login, course detail, list page).\n- Mark manual steps (captcha, 2FA) and provide a pause + resume checkpoint.\n- Decide the end condition (completion badge, video end, DOM state change).\n\n### 2) Implement deterministic candidate scanning\n\n- Collect clickable candidates from all frames (anchors, buttons, list items).\n- Attach metadata: text, href, data-key/resourceId, tag/class, domIndex, frame URL.\n- Run heuristic filtering first; only call LLM if needed.\n\n### 3) LLM selection (single shot)\n\n- Send a minimal payload with the candidate list and a strict JSON schema.\n- Parse JSON defensively; fall back to heuristic ordering if parsing fails.\n- Cache the selection per page to avoid repeated calls.\n\n### 4) Execute playback loop\n\n- Click the selected item, wait for `video` to appear, force mute + playbackRate.\n- Poll progress every N seconds; stop when progress reaches 100% or completion DOM appears.\n- On failure: dump DOM + screenshot + current URL for support.\n\n### 5) Cost controls and reliability\n\n- Avoid LLM calls during long playback; only use it for selection.\n- Keep payload small (truncate text, drop large attributes).\n- Use timeouts and retries for video start.\n\n## References\n\n- See `references/node-llm-runner.md` for prompt templates, candidate schema, and error-handling patterns.\n\n## Notes for this repo\n\n- If working inside `codex_helper`, start from `tools/simple-runner-manual.js` and adapt it to the target site.\n- Keep the LLM call optional; prefer heuristic selection when possible.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:22.187Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents seeking efficient web automation using Node.js and Puppeteer.","zh":"适用于寻求使用 Node.js 和 Puppeteer 进行高效 Web 自动化的自动化代理。","ja":"Node.js と Puppeteer を使用した Web 自動化に優れた自動化エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Node.js와 Puppeteer를 사용한 효율적인 웹 자동화를 찾는 자동화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización que buscan una automatización web eficiente usando Node.js y Puppeteer.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation recherchant une automatisation web efficace utilisant Node.js et Puppeteer.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine effiziente Web-Automatisierung mit Node.js und Puppeteer suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que buscam automação web eficiente usando Node.js e Puppeteer.","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, ищущих эффективную автоматизацию веб-страниц с помощью Node.js и Puppeteer.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الأتمتة الذين يبحثون عن أتمتة ويب فعالة باستخدام Node.js و Puppeteer."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate manual Codex-driven page exploration using a single LLM call, driving the UI deterministically with Electron UI and Puppeteer, reducing the need for manual intervention and minimizing costs.","zh":"赋予代理使用单个 LLM 调用自动执行手动的 Codex 驱动的页面探索，使用 Electron UI 和 Puppeteer 驱动 UI 以确定性方式，减少手动干预的需要并最小化成本。","ja":"エージェントが単一の LLM 呼び出しで手動の Codex ドリブンのページ探索を自動化できるようにし、Electron UI と Puppeteer を使用して UI を確定的に駆動し、手動介入の必要性を減らし、コストを最小限に抑えることができます。","ko":"에이전트가 단일 LLM 호출을 사용하여 수동 코덱스驱动 페이지 탐색을 자동화 할 수 있도록 하며, Electron UI 및 Puppeteer를 사용하여 UI를 결정적으로 구동하여 수동 개입의 필요성을 줄이고 비용을 최소화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la exploración manual de páginas impulsada por Codex mediante una sola llamada a LLM, impulsando la UI de forma determinista con Electron UI y Puppeteer, reduciendo la necesidad de intervención manual y minimizando los costos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser l''exploration manuelle de pages dérivée de Codex à l''aide d''un seul appel LLM, en pilotant l''interface utilisateur de manière déterministe avec Electron UI et Puppeteer, en réduisant le besoin d''intervention manuelle et en minimisant les coûts.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die manuelle Codex-getriebene Seitenexploration durch einen einzigen LLM-Aufruf zu automatisieren, die Benutzeroberfläche deterministisch mit Electron UI und Puppeteer zu steuern, den Bedarf an manueller Intervention zu reduzieren und die Kosten zu minimieren.","pt":"Habilita agentes a automatizar a exploração manual de páginas impulsionada por Codex usando uma única chamada LLM, impulsionando a UI de forma determinística com Electron UI e Puppeteer, reduzindo a necessidade de intervenção manual e minimizando custos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать ручное исследование страниц, управляемое Codex, используя один вызов LLM, определяя UI детерминированно с помощью Electron UI и Puppeteer, снижая потребность в ручном вмешательстве и минимизируя затраты.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من أتمتة استكشاف الصفحات اليدوي الذي يتضمن Codex باستخدام مكالمة LLM واحدة ، مما يدفع واجهة المستخدم بطريقة حتمية مع Electron UI و Puppeteer ، وتقليل الحاجة إلى التدخل اليدوي وتقليل التكاليف إلى الحد الأدنى."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web page exploration for data extraction","Driving UI interactions deterministically for testing purposes","Optimizing web automation workflows using Node.js and LLM"],"zh":["自动执行网页探索以提取数据","以确定性方式驱动 UI 交互以进行测试","使用 Node.js 和 LLM 优化网页自动化工作流"],"ja":["データ抽出のために Web ページの探索を自動化する","テスト目的のために UI 相互作用を確定的に駆動する","Node.js と LLM を使用して Web 自動化ワークフローを最適化する"],"ko":["데이터 추출을 위해 웹 페이지 탐색을 자동화하는 것","테스트 목적으로 UI 상호 작용을 결정적으로 구동하는 것","Node.js 및 LLM을 사용하여 웹 자동화 워크플로를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la exploración de páginas web para la extracción de datos","Impulsar las interacciones de la UI de forma determinista para fines de prueba","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de automatización web utilizando Node.js y LLM"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''exploration de pages web pour l''extraction de données","Piloter les interactions de l''interface utilisateur de manière déterministe à des fins de test","Optimisation des flux de travail d''automatisation web en utilisant Node.js et LLM"],"de":["Automatisierung der Webseiten-Exploration für die Datenextraktion","Lenken der UI-Interaktionen deterministisch für Testzwecke","Optimierung der Web-Automatisierungs-Workflows unter Verwendung von Node.js und LLM"],"pt":["Automatizar a exploração de páginas web para extração de dados","Dirigir interações de UI de forma determinística para fins de teste","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de automação web usando Node.js e LLM"],"ru":["Автоматизация исследования веб-страниц для извлечения данных","Определение взаимодействий UI детерминированно для целей тестирования","Оптимизация потоков работы автоматизации веб-страниц с помощью Node.js и LLM"],"ar":["أتمتة استكشاف صفحات الويب لاستخراج البيانات","تشغيل التفاعلات الواجهة المستخدم بطريقة حتمية لأغراض الاختبار","تحسين سير عمل أتمتة الويب باستخدام Node.js و LLM"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Dependent on Puppeteer and Electron UI for automation","Needs definition of automation scope and end conditions"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 环境","依赖 Puppeteer 和 Electron UI 进行自动化","需要定义自动化范围和结束条件"],"ja":["Node.js 環境が必要","Puppeteer と Electron UI に依存して自動化する","自動化の範囲と終了条件の定義が必要"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요합니다.","Puppeteer 및 Electron UI에 의존하여 자동화합니다.","자동화 범위 및 종료 조건의 정의가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere un entorno Node.js","Dependiente de Puppeteer y Electron UI para la automatización","Requiere la definición del ámbito y las condiciones finales de la automatización"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Dépendant de Puppeteer et Electron UI pour l''automatisation","Nécessite la définition de la portée et des conditions finales de l''automatisation"],"de":["Benötigt eine Node.js-Umgebung","Abhängig von Puppeteer und Electron UI für die Automatisierung","Benötigt die Definition des Automatisierungsumfangs und der Endbedingungen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Node.js","Dependente de Puppeteer e Electron UI para automação","Necessita definição do escopo e condições finais de automação"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js","Зависит от Puppeteer и Electron UI для автоматизации","Требует определения объема и конечных условий автоматизации"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","يعتمد على Puppeteer و Electron UI للأتمتة","يحتاج إلى تعريف نطاق وشرط نهاية الأتمتة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c6fe1d33b3643e39b2fcc08c4862b76fa00ca6df02cd98b4b1dea73ea78fc729","qualityScore":26}');
