n paquete que incluye una implementación de React, metadatos y una estructura de compatibilidad.","fr":"Une définition de composant Canvas est un paquet qui inclut une mise en œuvre de React, des métadonnées et une structure de compatibilité.","de":"Eine Definition einer Canvas-Komponente ist ein Paket, das eine React-Implementierung, Metadaten und eine Kompatibilitätsstruktur enthält.","pt":"O que é canvas-component-definition? Um pacote de React e metadados Canvas para componentes personalizados","ru":"Что такое canvas-component-definition? Пакет React и метаданных Canvas для кастомных компонентов","ar":"ما هو مركب Canvas؟ حزمة من React وبيانات تعريف Canvas لإنشاء مكونات مخصصة"},"features":{"en":["Requires a React implementation via index.jsx","Incorporates Canvas metadata/schema via component.yml","Ensures naming and structure compatibility with machineName and folder path","Supports Canvas-compatible props/slots modeling","Mandates a specific folder structure at components-root/machine-name/","Enforces a minimum contract for usability in Drupal Canvas"],"zh":["React 实现（index.jsx）","元数据/模式定义（component.yml）","命名和结构兼容性（machineName、文件夹路径、故事路径）","Canvas 兼容的 props/slots 模型","支持 Drupal Canvas"],"ja":["React 実装（index.jsx）","メタデータ/スキーマ定義（component.yml）","命名と構造の互換性（machineName、フォルダパス、ストーリーパス）","Canvas 互換の props/slots モデル","Drupal Canvas をサポート"],"ko":["React 구현（index.jsx）","메타데이터/스키마 정의（component.yml）","이름과 구조의 호환성（machineName、폴더 경로、스토리 경로）","Canvas 호환 props/slots 모델","Drupal Canvas 지원"],"es":["Implementación de React (index.jsx)","Metadatos y esquema (component.yml)","Estructura de compatibilidad (machineName, ruta de carpeta, ruta de historia)","Modelado de propiedades y ranuras compatibles con Canvas","Compatibilidad con Drupal Canvas"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de React (index.jsx)","Métadonnées et schéma (component.yml)","Structure de compatibilité (machineName, chemin de dossier, chemin d''histoire)","Modélisation de propriétés et de fentes compatibles avec Canvas","Compatibilité avec Drupal Canvas"],"de":["React-Implementierung (index.jsx)","Metadaten und Schema (component.yml)","Kompatibilitätsstruktur (machineName, Ordnerpfad, Historienpfad)","Modellierung von Eigenschaften und Schlitzen, die mit Canvas kompatibel sind","Kompatibilität mit Drupal Canvas"],"pt":["Implementação React personalizada","Metadados Canvas para componentes","Estrutura de pasta compatível com machineName","Modelagem de props/slots compatível com Canvas"],"ru":["Пользовательская реализация React","Метаданные Canvas для компонентов","Совместимая структура папок с machineName","Моделирование props/slots, совместимое с Canvas"],"ar":["تنفيذ React مخصص","بيانات تعريف Canvas للمكونات","هيكل مجلد متوافق مع machineName","نمذجة props/slots متوافقة مع Canvas"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use canvas-component-definition","what is canvas-component-definition","canvas-component-definition setup guide","canvas-component-definition install","canvas-component-definition vs Drupal components","canvas-component-definition alternative","creating compatible Canvas components","React implementation for Canvas","Canvas metadata/schema best practices"],"zh":["Canvas 组件定义","React 实现","元数据定义","兼容性要求","Drupal Canvas","AIエージェント","Canvas 组件设置","React 开发","元数据管理"],"ja":["Canvas コンポーネント定義","React 実装","メタデータ定義","兼容性要件","Drupal Canvas","AIエージェント","Canvas コンポーネント設定","React 開発","メタデータ管理"],"ko":["Canvas 컴포넌트 정의","React 구현","메타데이터 정의","호환성 요구 사항","Drupal Canvas","AI 에이전트","Canvas 컴포넌트 설정","React 개발","메타데이터 관리"],"es":["definición de componente de Canvas","React en Canvas","metadatos de Canvas","estructura de compatibilidad de Canvas","Drupal Canvas","desarrollo de componentes de Canvas","creación de componentes de Canvas","compatibilidad de componentes de Canvas"],"fr":["définition de composant Canvas","React dans Canvas","métadonnées de Canvas","structure de compatibilité de Canvas","Drupal Canvas","développement de composants Canvas","création de composants Canvas","compatibilité de composants Canvas"],"de":["Definition einer Canvas-Komponente","React in Canvas","Metadaten von Canvas","Kompatibilitätsstruktur von Canvas","Drupal Canvas","Entwicklung von Canvas-Komponenten","Erstellung von Canvas-Komponenten","Kompatibilität von Canvas-Komponenten"],"pt":["canvas-component-definition","React para desenvolvedores","Drupal Canvas tutorial","componentes personalizados","metadados Canvas","estrutura de pasta compatível"],"ru":["canvas-component-definition","React для разработчиков","Drupal Canvas уроки","кастомные компоненты","метаданные Canvas","совместимая структура папок"],"ar":["مركب Canvas","React للأشخاص المطورين","دليل Drupal Canvas","مكونات مخصصة","بيانات تعريف Canvas","هيكل مجلد متوافق"]}},"owner":"acquia","repo":"nebula","repoPath":"acquia/nebula","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"canvas-component-definition","description":"","bodyPreview":"## Canonical definition\n\nA Canvas component is a package of:\n\n1. A React implementation (`index.jsx`)\n2. Canvas metadata/schema (`component.yml`)\n3. Naming and structure compatibility (`machineName`, folder path, story path)\n4. Canvas-compatible props/slots modeling\n\nAll four parts are required for the component to be usable in Drupal Canvas.\n\n## Minimum contract (MUST)\n\nEvery Canvas component MUST satisfy all checks below:\n\n- Component folder exists at `<components-root>/<machine-name>/` (use t","body":"## Canonical definition\n\nA Canvas component is a package of:\n\n1. A React implementation (`index.jsx`)\n2. Canvas metadata/schema (`component.yml`)\n3. Naming and structure compatibility (`machineName`, folder path, story path)\n4. Canvas-compatible props/slots modeling\n\nAll four parts are required for the component to be usable in Drupal Canvas.\n\n## Minimum contract (MUST)\n\nEvery Canvas component MUST satisfy all checks below:\n\n- Component folder exists at `<components-root>/<machine-name>/` (use the\n  repository''s configured components root, which may be defined in `.env`)\n- React implementation exists at `<components-root>/<machine-name>/index.jsx`\n- Metadata exists at `<components-root>/<machine-name>/component.yml`\n- `component.yml` includes required top-level keys (`name`, `machineName`,\n  `status`, `required`, `props`, `slots`)\n- Folder name exactly matches `machineName` in `component.yml` (kebab-case)\n- A matching story exists at `<stories-root>/<machine-name>.stories.jsx` (use\n  the repository''s configured stories root)\n- Props/slots follow Canvas rules (for example, avoid unsupported\n  array-of-object prop shapes; use slots for repeatable complex content)\n\nIf any item is missing, the component is incomplete for Canvas usage.\n\n## Naming guidance\n\nUse `references/naming.md` for naming rules and examples.\n\n## Skill coordination\n\nEvaluate using companion skills in this order.\n\n1. `canvas-component-metadata`\n   - Use when creating/changing `component.yml`, props/slots, enums, or fixing\n     prop validation errors.\n2. `canvas-component-composability`\n   - Use when designing prop/slot structure, decomposing large components,\n     deciding props vs slots, or modeling repeatable list/grid content.\n3. `canvas-styling-conventions`\n   - Use for all styling work: new components, style props, Tailwind token\n     usage, CVA variants, class changes, and prop changes that affect styles.\n4. `canvas-component-utils`\n   - Use when rendering formatted HTML text or media via `FormattedText` and\n     `Image`.\n5. `canvas-data-fetching`\n   - Use when fetching/rendering Drupal content with JSON:API, SWR, includes,\n     and filter patterns.\n6. `canvas-component-upload`\n   - Use after implementation is complete and validated, when uploading and\n     recovering from upload failures.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:13.138Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing compatible Canvas component creation for Drupal Canvas, utilizing React implementation and metadata.","zh":"适用于需要兼容的Canvas组件创建的前端代理，利用React实现和元数据，用于Drupal Canvas。","ja":"Reactの実装とメタデータを使用して、Drupal Canvasの互換性のあるCanvasコンポーネントを作成する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"React 구현 및 메타데이터를 사용하여 Drupal Canvas와 호환되는 Canvas 컴포넌트를 생성해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan crear componentes de Canvas compatibles para Drupal Canvas, utilizando la implementación de React y metadatos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de créer des composants de Canvas compatibles pour Drupal Canvas, en utilisant la mise en œuvre de React et des métadonnées.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die kompatible Canvas-Komponenten für Drupal Canvas erstellen müssen, unter Verwendung der React-Implementierung und Metadaten.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de criação de componentes Canvas compatíveis para Drupal Canvas, utilizando implementação React e metadados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима совместимая создание компонентов Canvas для Drupal Canvas, использующая реализацию React и метаданные.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء مكونات Canvas متوافقة مع Drupal Canvas، باستخدام تنفيذ React والبيانات الوصفية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compatible Canvas components with proper React implementation, Canvas metadata/schema, and naming structure, ensuring seamless integration with Drupal Canvas using component.yml and index.jsx files.","zh":"赋予代理创建兼容的Canvas组件的能力，具有适当的React实现、Canvas元数据/架构和命名结构，确保与Drupal Canvas使用component.yml和index.jsx文件的无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが適切なReactの実装、Canvasメタデータ/スキーマ、および命名構造を備えた互換性のあるCanvasコンポーネントを作成できるようにし、component.ymlおよびindex.jsxファイルを使用してDrupal Canvasとのシームレスな統合を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 적절한 React 구현, Canvas 메타데이터/스키마 및 이름 구조를 갖춘 호환되는 Canvas 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 component.yml 및 index.jsx 파일을 사용하여 Drupal Canvas와의 무결점 통합을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de Canvas compatibles con una implementación de React adecuada, metadatos/esquema de Canvas y estructura de nombre, lo que garantiza una integración sin problemas con Drupal Canvas mediante archivos component.yml e index.jsx.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants de Canvas compatibles avec une mise en œuvre de React appropriée, des métadonnées/schéma de Canvas et une structure de nom, garantissant une intégration transparente avec Drupal Canvas via les fichiers component.yml et index.jsx.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, kompatible Canvas-Komponenten mit einer geeigneten React-Implementierung, Canvas-Metadaten/Schemata und Namensstruktur zu erstellen, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Drupal Canvas über die Dateien component.yml und index.jsx ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes Canvas compatíveis com implementação React adequada, metadados/esquema Canvas e estrutura de nomenclatura, garantindo integração perfeita com Drupal Canvas usando arquivos component.yml e index.jsx.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать совместимые компоненты Canvas с правильной реализацией React, метаданными/схемой Canvas и структурой названий, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с Drupal Canvas с помощью файлов component.yml и index.jsx.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات Canvas متوافقة مع تنفيذ React المناسب وبيانات.schema Canvas وهيكل التسمية، مما يضمن التكامل السلس مع Drupal Canvas باستخدام الملفات component.yml و index.jsx."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating reusable Canvas components for Drupal projects"," Validating component compatibility with Drupal Canvas","Automating component metadata generation for efficient development"],"zh":["为Drupal项目创建可重用的Canvas组件","验证组件与Drupal Canvas的兼容性","自动生成组件元数据以实现高效开发"],"ja":["Drupalプロジェクト用の再利用可能なCanvasコンポーネントを作成する","コンポーネントのDrupal Canvasとの互換性を検証する","コンポーネントメタデータを自動生成して効率的な開発を行う"],"ko":["Drupal 프로젝트를 위한 재사용 가능한 Canvas 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것","컴포넌트가 Drupal Canvas와 호환되는지 확인","컴포넌트 메타데이터를 자동으로 생성하여 효율적인 개발"],"es":["Crear componentes de Canvas reutilizables para proyectos de Drupal","Validar la compatibilidad de los componentes con Drupal Canvas","Automatizar la generación de metadatos de componentes para un desarrollo eficiente"],"fr":["Créer des composants de Canvas réutilisables pour les projets Drupal","Valider la compatibilité des composants avec Drupal Canvas","Automatiser la génération de métadonnées de composants pour un développement efficace"],"de":["Erstellen von wiederverwendbaren Canvas-Komponenten für Drupal-Projekte","Überprüfen der Kompatibilität von Komponenten mit Drupal Canvas","Automatisieren der Metadatengenerierung von Komponenten für eine effiziente Entwicklung"],"pt":["Criar componentes Canvas reutilizáveis para projetos Drupal","Validar a compatibilidade do componente com Drupal Canvas","Automatizar a geração de metadados de componentes para desenvolvimento eficiente"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов Canvas для проектов Drupal","Проверка совместимости компонента с Drupal Canvas","Автоматизация генерации метаданных компонентов для эффективного развития"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Canvas قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لمشاريع Drupal","التحقق من توافق المكون مع Drupal Canvas","التحكم الآلي في توليد بيانات وصفية للمكونات من أجل التطوير الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Drupal Canvas environment","Must adhere to specific naming and structure conventions","Limited to React implementation"],"zh":["需要Drupal Canvas环境","必须遵循特定的命名和结构约定","仅限于React实现"],"ja":["Drupal Canvas環境が必要","特定の命名および構造規約に従う必要がある","Reactの実装のみに限定される"],"ko":["Drupal Canvas 환경이 필요함","특정 이름 및 구조 규칙을 따라야 함","React 구현만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Drupal Canvas","Debe adherirse a convenciones de nomenclatura y estructura específicas","Limitado a la implementación de React"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de Drupal Canvas","Doit respecter des conventions de nommage et de structure spécifiques","Limité à la mise en œuvre de React"],"de":["Benötigt eine Drupal Canvas-Umgebung","Muss bestimmten Benennungs- und Strukturkonventionen entsprechen","Begrenzt auf die React-Implementierung"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Drupal Canvas","Deve aderir a convenções específicas de nomenclatura e estrutura","Limitado à implementação React"],"ru":["Требуется среда Drupal Canvas","Должно соблюдать определенные соглашения об именовании и структуре","Ограничен реализацией React"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Drupal Canvas","يجب اتباع اتفاقيات تسمية وهيكلية محددة","محدود بتنفيذ React"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4381dd0acfedcd11b84bb6775b757e68870371419d4565401b16461b1d1d9ce7","qualityScore":26}');
