havior as if using a time machine to debug issues.","zh":"Replay MCP是一种用于分析浏览器录制的调试工具","ja":"Replay MCPは、ブラウザレコーディングを調査するためのデバッグツールである","ko":"Replay MCP는 브라우저 녹화 파일을 분석하는 디버깅 도구입니다","es":"Replay MCP es una herramienta de desarrollo web que permite inspeccionar grabaciones de aplicaciones web","fr":"Replay MCP est un outil de développement web qui permet d''inspecter les enregistrements d''applications web","de":"Replay MCP ist ein Webentwicklungstool, das die Untersuchung von Aufzeichnungen von Webanwendungen ermöglicht","pt":"Replay MCP é uma ferramenta de inspeção de gravações que permite investigar o comportamento de aplicativos web","ru":"Replay MCP - это инструмент для изучения записей, позволяющий исследовать поведение веб-приложений с помощью ИИ Агентов","ar":"Replay MCP هو أداة فحص تسجيلات تتيح لك調査 سلوك التطبيقات الويب"},"features":{"en":["Inspects contents of replay.io browser recordings","Analyzes perfect captures of web page visits","Provides tools for investigating app behavior","Enables answering precise questions about app functionality"],"zh":["支持https://replay.io录制文件的分析","能够详细分析应用行为","提供时间机器功能，能够回放应用行为","支持探索和调查应用行为","能够回答应用行为相关的问题"],"ja":["https://replay.ioレコーディングファイルの分析をサポート","アプリケーションの動作を詳細に分析する","タイムマシン機能を提供し、アプリケーションの動作を再生する","アプリケーションの動作を探索および調査する","アプリケーションの動作に関する質問に回答する"],"ko":["https://replay.io 녹화 파일 분석 지원","애플리케이션 동작을 자세히 분석","시간 여행 기능 제공, 애플리케이션 동작 재생","애플리케이션 동작 탐색 및 조사","애플리케이션 동작 관련 질문에 대한 답변"],"es":["Inspección de grabaciones de aplicaciones web","Exploración del comportamiento de la app en el tiempo","Investigación detallada del comportamiento de la app","Uso de herramientas de desarrollo web para analizar grabaciones","Compatibilidad con grabaciones de https://replay.io"],"fr":["Inspection des enregistrements d''applications web","Exploration du comportement de l''application dans le temps","Enquête détaillée sur le comportement de l''application","Utilisation d''outils de développement web pour analyser les enregistrements","Compatibilité avec les enregistrements de https://replay.io"],"de":["Untersuchung von Aufzeichnungen von Webanwendungen","Exploration des Verhaltens der App in der Zeit","Detaillierte Analyse des Verhaltens der App","Verwendung von Webentwicklungstools zur Analyse von Aufzeichnungen","Kompatibilität mit Aufzeichnungen von https://replay.io"],"pt":["Inspecionar gravações de aplicativos web","Explorar e investigar o comportamento do app","Usar ferramentas de inspeção para entender o comportamento do app","Investigar gravações de aplicativos web como se você tivesse uma máquina do tempo","Analisar o comportamento do app com precisão"],"ru":["Изучать записи веб-приложений","Исследовать и анализировать поведение приложения с помощью ИИ Агентов","Использовать инструменты для изучения записей","Изучать записи веб-приложений как если бы вы имели машину времени","Анализировать поведение приложения с точностью"],"ar":["فحص تسجيلات التطبيقات الويب","فحص وسلوك التطبيق","استخدام أدوات الفحص لفهم سلوك التطبيق","فحص تسجيلات التطبيقات الويب كما لو كنت تمتلك آلة زمنية","تحليل سلوك التطبيق بدقة"]},"keywords":{"en":["what is replay-mcp","how to use replay-mcp for debugging","replay-mcp vs browser devtools","replay-mcp alternative","replay-mcp install guide","replay-mcp setup for AI agents","investigate replay.io recordings","analyze browser session replays"],"zh":["Replay MCP","浏览器录制调试","AI工具","应用行为分析","时间机器功能","Replay IO","调试工具"],"ja":["Replay MCP","ブラウザレコーディング調査","AIエージェント","アプリケーションの動作分析","タイムマシン機能","Replay IO","デバッグツール"],"ko":["Replay MCP","브라우저 녹화 파일 분석","AI 도구","애플리케이션 동작 분석","시간 여행 기능","Replay IO","디버깅 도구"],"es":["Replay MCP","herramientas de desarrollo web","inspección de grabaciones","análisis de comportamiento de aplicaciones","desarrollo web","Replay.io","grabaciones de aplicaciones web","investigación de errores","depuración de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Replay MCP","outils de développement web","inspection des enregistrements","analyse du comportement des applications","développement web","Replay.io","enregistrements d''applications web","recherche de bugs","débogage d''applications"],"de":["Replay MCP","Webentwicklungstools","Untersuchung von Aufzeichnungen","Analyse des Verhaltens von Webanwendungen","Webentwicklung","Replay.io","Aufzeichnungen von Webanwendungen","Fehlersuche","Debugging von Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Replay MCP","ferramentas de inspeção","gravações de aplicativos web","comportamento do app","máquina do tempo","análise de comportamento","desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Replay MCP","инструменты для изучения записей","записи веб-приложений","поведение приложения","машина времени","анализ поведения","веб-разработка","инструменты для разработки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Replay MCP","أدوات الفحص","تسجيلات التطبيقات الويب","سلوك التطبيق","آلة زمنية","تحليل السلوك","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير","الأدوات الذكية"]}},"owner":"filiphric","repo":"hydration-error-demo","repoPath":"filiphric/hydration-error-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.454Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"replay-mcp","description":"Use Replay MCP to inspect the contents of https://replay.io recordings.","bodyPreview":"# Overview\n\nThis document provides an overview of the tools available when using Replay MCP\nand how to use these tools to investigate recordings.\n\nReplay MCP is used to inspect the contents of https://replay.io recordings.\nThese recordings perfectly capture everything that happened when a browser\nvisited an app or other web page. You can explore and investigate the app''s behavior\nas if you are a detective with a time machine.\n\nAny question about the app behaved can be answered precisely using da","body":"# Overview\n\nThis document provides an overview of the tools available when using Replay MCP\nand how to use these tools to investigate recordings.\n\nReplay MCP is used to inspect the contents of https://replay.io recordings.\nThese recordings perfectly capture everything that happened when a browser\nvisited an app or other web page. You can explore and investigate the app''s behavior\nas if you are a detective with a time machine.\n\nAny question about the app behaved can be answered precisely using data from the\nrecording. The most important thing to remember when using Replay MCP to investigate\na recording is to not jump to conclusions:\n\n1. Frame your task in the form of a question that you need to answer.\n1. Use exploratory tools to identify things that happened in the recording related\n   to the question.\n2. Use explanatory tools to understand why those things happened.\n3. Form a hypothesis and identify data you gathered which justifies that hypothesis.\n4. Explain the answer referring to the data supporting your conclusion.\n\n## Terms\n\nThe recording is essentially a gigantic database containing everything that happened\nwhile the app executed. A couple terms are useful for understanding this database:\n\n* Point: A specific point in the execution of the app. There is a unique point created\nfor every time a JS statement executes or any other interesting event with potential\nside effects on the app''s state.\n\n* Element: A reference for a particular DOM element that is independent of any particular point.\nEach DOM element has a lifetime for some portion of the recording.\n\n# Exploratory Tools\n\nExploratory tools are used to discover what happened in the recording and when.\n\n## Errors\n\nError tools identify major errors that occurred in the app which may cause it to break.\n\n* UncaughtException: An exception was thrown and not caught by anything.\n* ReactException: An exception was thrown while rendering a React component, causing the tree to unmount.\n\n## Timeline\n\nTimeline tools describe sequences of events for what happened across the recording.\n\n* Timeline: Combines data from other timeline tools to show interesting events in order.\n* ConsoleMessages: Shows all messages logged to the console.\n* LocalStorage: Shows all accesses made to local storage.\n* NetworkRequest: Shows all network requests made, or details about a specific request.\n* ReactRenders: Shows all React renders and the rendered components.\n\n## Sources\n\nSource tools get information about the JS sources in the app and what code executed.\nWhen showing source code in these and other tools, hit counts are shown for each line.\nA blank value is used for lines that have no breakpoints.\n\n* ListSources: Find source files by name.\n* ReadSource: Read the contents of a source and show what code executed.\n* SearchSources: Search the contents of all sources for a pattern and show what code executed.\n\n# Explanatory Tools\n\nExplanatory tools are used to understand why particular things happened in the recording.\n\n## Dependencies\n\nDependency tools track happens-before relationships between events in the recording.\nThis is useful to understand why particular events happened or didn''t happen.\n\n* GetStack: Show the on stack frames at a point.\n* ControlDependency: Describe the events in a recording that triggered execution of a point.\n\n## Details\n\nDetail tools show additional details about the app''s state at particular points.\n\n* DescribePoint: Describe a point''s location and variable values.\n* InspectElement: Describe a DOM element''s details.\n* ReactComponents: Describe the React component tree at a point.\n* Logpoint: Show the points and values of an expression every time a statement executed.\n* Evaluate: Evaluate an expression at a particular point.\n\n# Tips\n\nWhen understanding JS behavior it is a good idea to find code relevant to the question being answered,\nsee whether that code executed at all, and get details about the times when it executed.\nThe Logpoint tool is extremely useful for this: see the value of the same expression whenever a\nstatement executed, look for anything unexpected, and continue investigating from there.\n\nWhen understanding the timing around a particular event (e.g. why it happened later than desired),\nfind a point in the recording associated with the event and use the ControlDependency tool to explore\nthe events that had to happen first and any associated delays.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:03.622Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Debugging Agents requiring precise forensic analysis of browser session recordings.","zh":"非常适合需要精确分析浏览器会话录制内容的 Web Debugging Agents 进行取证分析。","ja":"ブラウザセッション記録の精密なフォレンジック分析を必要とする Web Debugging Agents に最適です。","ko":"브라우저 세션 기록에 대한 정밀한 포렌식 분석이 필요한 Web Debugging Agents에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Depuración Web que requieren un análisis forense preciso de grabaciones de sesiones del navegador.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de débogage Web nécessitant une analyse forensique précise des enregistrements de sessions de navigateur.","de":"Ideal für Web-Debugging-Agents, die eine präzise forensische Analyse von Browsersitzungs-Aufzeichnungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Depuração da Web que necessitam de análise forense precisa de gravações de sessões de navegador.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-отладки, требующих точного судебного анализа записей сеансов браузера.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تصحيح أخطاء الويب الذي يتطلب تحليلًا تشخيصيًا دقيقًا لتسجيلات جلسات المتصفح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct inspection of replay.io recordings to investigate web application behavior with perfect session capture capabilities. Provides tools for answering precise questions about app functionality as if examining a time machine recording of browser interactions.","zh":"支持直接检查 replay.io 录制内容，利用完美的会话捕获功能来调查 Web 应用程序行为。提供用于精确回答有关应用程序功能问题的工具，如同检查浏览器交互的时间机器录制。","ja":"完璧なセッションキャプチャ機能を備えた replay.io 記録を直接検査し、Webアプリケーションの動作を調査できます。ブラウザインタラクションのタイムマシン記録を調べるかのように、アプリ機能に関する正確な質問に答えるためのツールを提供します。","ko":"완벽한 세션 캡처 기능으로 replay.io 기록을 직접 검사하여 웹 애플리케이션 동작을 조사할 수 있게 합니다. 브라우저 상호작용의 타임머신 기록을 검사하는 것처럼 앱 기능에 대한 정확한 질문에 답변할 수 있는 도구를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la inspección directa de grabaciones de replay.io para investigar el comportamiento de aplicaciones web con capacidades de captura de sesión perfectas. Proporciona herramientas para responder a preguntas precisas sobre la funcionalidad de la aplicación, como si se examinara una grabación de una máquina del tiempo de interacciones del navegador.","fr":"Permet l''inspection directe des enregistrements de replay.io pour enquêter sur le comportement des applications Web avec des capacités de capture de session parfaites. Fournit des outils pour répondre à des questions précises sur la fonctionnalité de l''application, comme si l''on examinait une enregistrement d''une machine à remonter le temps d''interactions du navigateur.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Inspektion von replay.io-Aufzeichnungen, um das Verhalten von Webanwendungen mit perfekten Sitzungsaufzeichnungsfunktionen zu untersuchen. Bietet Tools, um präzise Fragen zur Funktionalität der Anwendung zu beantworten, als ob man eine Aufzeichnung einer Zeitmaschine von Browser-Interaktionen untersuchen würde.","pt":"Permite a inspeção direta de gravações do replay.io para investigar o comportamento de aplicativos da web com capacidades de captura de sessão perfeitas. Fornece ferramentas para responder a perguntas precisas sobre a funcionalidade do aplicativo, como se estivesse examinando uma gravação de máquina do tempo de interações do navegador.","ru":"Позволяет直接 осмотреть записи replay.io для расследования поведения веб-приложений с идеальными возможностями захвата сессии. Предоставляет инструменты для ответа на точные вопросы о функциональности приложения, как если бы вы изучали запись времени взаимодействия браузера.","ar":"تمكن من فحص مباشر لتسجيلات replay.io للتحقيق في سلوك تطبيق الويب بقدرات 捕获 جلسة مثالية. يوفر أدوات للإجابة على أسئلة دقيقة حول وظائف التطبيق، كما لو كنت تحقق في تسجيل لمكنة زمنية للتفاعلات المتصفح."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging web application failures","Investigating user session behavior","Analyzing network request sequences","Validating UI interaction flows"],"zh":["调试 Web 应用程序故障","调查用户会话行为","分析网络请求序列","验证 UI 交互流程"],"ja":["Webアプリケーション障害のデバッグ","ユーザーセッション行動の調査","ネットワークリクエストシーケンスの分析","UIインタラクションフローの検証"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션 장애 디버깅","사용자 세션 동작 조사","네트워크 요청 시퀀스 분석","UI 상호작용 흐름 검증"],"es":["Depuración de fallos de aplicaciones web","Investigación del comportamiento de sesiones de usuario","Análisis de secuencias de solicitudes de red","Validación de flujos de interacción de UI"],"fr":["Débogage des défaillances d''applications Web","Enquête sur le comportement des sessions d''utilisateur","Analyse des séquences de requêtes réseau","Validation des flux d''interaction de l''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung von Webanwendungsfehlern","Untersuchung des Benutzersitzungsverhaltens","Analyse von Netzwerkanforderungssequenzen","Validierung von Benutzeroberflächen-Interaktionsflüssen"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de aplicativos da web","Investigação do comportamento da sessão do usuário","Análise de sequências de solicitações de rede","Validação de fluxos de interação da interface do usuário"],"ru":["Отладка сбоев веб-приложений","Расследование поведения пользовательской сессии","Анализ последовательностей сетевых запросов","Проверка потоков взаимодействия пользовательского интерфейса"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء تطبيق الويب","تحقيق في سلوك جلسة المستخدم","تحليل تسلسلات طلبات الشبكة","التحقق من تدفقات التفاعل مع واجهة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires replay.io recording files","Limited to browser session analysis only","Dependent on replay.io recording format compatibility"],"zh":["需要 replay.io 录制文件","仅限于浏览器会话分析","依赖 replay.io 录制格式的兼容性"],"ja":["replay.io 記録ファイルが必要","ブラウザセッション分析のみに限定","replay.io 記録フォーマットの互換性に依存"],"ko":["replay.io 기록 파일 필요","브라우저 세션 분석으로만 제한됨","replay.io 기록 형식 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere archivos de grabación de replay.io","Limitado solo al análisis de sesiones del navegador","Dependiente de la compatibilidad del formato de grabación de replay.io"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers d''enregistrement de replay.io","Limité à l''analyse de sessions de navigateur uniquement","Dépend de la compatibilité du format d''enregistrement de replay.io"],"de":["Benötigt replay.io-Aufzeichnungsdateien","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Browsersitzungen nur","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität des replay.io-Aufzeichnungsformats"],"pt":["Requer arquivos de gravação do replay.io","Limitado apenas à análise de sessões do navegador","Dependente da compatibilidade do formato de gravação do replay.io"],"ru":["Требует файлов записи replay.io","Ограничен только анализом сеансов браузера","Зависит от совместимости формата записи replay.io"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات تسجيل replay.io","محدود فقط بتحليل جلسات المتصفح","يعتمد على توافق تنسيق تسجيل replay.io"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e0d8f93268bbfd0c78fd457fde8da90fe5884989f5748321fbe01d7be1f1e400","qualityScore":26}');
